asr-001707
01:43:28.660 --> 01:43:29.780
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001708
01:43:30.700 --> 01:43:31.500
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yes po.

asr-001709
01:43:31.600 --> 01:43:33.560
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Maraming salamat, Madam Chair,

