01:43:33.700 --> 01:43:35.340
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Mr. Chair, Mr. Congressman,

asr-001711
01:43:35.340 --> 01:43:36.260
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: sa tanong.

asr-001712
01:43:36.380 --> 01:43:39.480
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: At yung pong PhilHealth is mandatory.

asr-001713
01:43:40.020 --> 01:43:42.520
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: It's prescribed by law.

asr-001714
01:43:43.960 --> 01:43:46.180
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Siguro masasabi ko lang dito muna

asr-001715
01:43:46.180 --> 01:43:46.820
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: at the outset

asr-001716
01:43:46.820 --> 01:43:48.640
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: ay hindi ho kami miyembro

asr-001717
01:43:48.640 --> 01:43:49.500
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: ng PhilHealth Board,

asr-001718
01:43:49.500 --> 01:43:51.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: but we will make a proposal

asr-001719
01:43:51.880 --> 01:43:53.780
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: to amend the PhilHealth law

asr-001720
01:43:53.780 --> 01:43:56.020
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: kasi DOLE po, nung nasa DOLE pa kami,

asr-001721
01:43:56.800 --> 01:43:57.600
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: DOLE represented

asr-001722
01:43:57.600 --> 01:43:59.720
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: the overseas Filipino workers

asr-001723
01:43:59.720 --> 01:44:00.740
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: at the PhilHealth Board.

asr-001724
01:44:00.900 --> 01:44:02.700
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So baka mainam po na

asr-001725
01:44:02.700 --> 01:44:04.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: bigyan kami ng seat ng OWWA

asr-001726
01:44:04.880 --> 01:44:05.920
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: sa PhilHealth Board

asr-001727
01:44:05.920 --> 01:44:10.140
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: to represent the OFW interest kasi nagko-contribute din ng OFW

asr-001728
01:44:10.140 --> 01:44:11.020
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: sa PhilHealth Fund.

asr-001729
01:44:12.360 --> 01:44:13.560
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And pangalawa,

asr-001730
01:44:15.320 --> 01:44:16.040
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: admittedly po,

asr-001731
01:44:16.900 --> 01:44:18.240
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: perhaps we need

asr-001732
01:44:18.240 --> 01:44:19.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: of course

asr-001733
01:44:19.880 --> 01:44:22.200
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Of course, President Beverly Ho is known

asr-001734
01:44:22.200 --> 01:44:24.000
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: to us. She's a good colleague

asr-001735
01:44:24.000 --> 01:44:26.100
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: from way back during the

asr-001736
01:44:26.100 --> 01:44:28.420
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: health crisis, previous health crisis

asr-001737
01:44:28.420 --> 01:44:29.900
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: pandemic.

asr-001738
01:44:31.160 --> 01:44:32.200
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But perhaps

asr-001739
01:44:32.200 --> 01:44:33.560
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: we need to make a call to

asr-001740
01:44:33.560 --> 01:44:36.140
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: President Ho and find out

asr-001741
01:44:36.140 --> 01:44:38.140
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: exactly how we could partner

asr-001742
01:44:38.140 --> 01:44:40.020
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: with PhilHealth. But the way

asr-001743
01:44:40.020 --> 01:44:41.960
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: the Overseas Action Fund works

asr-001744
01:44:41.960 --> 01:44:43.520
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: is that kami po,

asr-001745
01:44:43.640 --> 01:44:46.080
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: naglalabas kami ng

asr-001746
01:44:46.080 --> 01:44:47.740
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: pera at wala ho kaming

asr-001747
01:44:47.740 --> 01:44:50.480
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: ceiling sa tinutulungan

asr-001748
01:44:50.860 --> 01:44:52.620
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: ng ating OFWs na kailangan magbayad

asr-001749
01:44:52.620 --> 01:44:54.040
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: ng hospital bills at gamot.

asr-001750
01:44:55.060 --> 01:45:11.180
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But, ang kailangan ko lang ho i-emphasize dito, kapag may insurance coverage ang OFW, at karamihan naman po, majority of OFWs do have host country insurance coverage in fairness, hinahayaan ho muna natin magbayad yung insurance cover nila.

asr-001751
01:45:12.200 --> 01:45:27.800
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kaya meron din hong mandatory insurance from our side, so hinahayaan din natin magbayad yung insurance, private insurance from our side. Kung wala pong insurance coverage on either side, doon po papasok ang AKSYON Fund.

asr-001752
01:45:27.960 --> 01:45:40.580
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And I must say, pag nagbayad po tayo ng hospital bills, assuming that we had negotiated with the hospital at a barest minimum kung ano yung maitatalaga nilang hospital bill expense,

asr-001753
01:45:41.360 --> 01:46:07.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: binabayaran po natin, Mr. Chair, we do not even set a ceiling as I mentioned. So by way of example, kung malubha yung isang kaso nating stage 4 cancer, more than a million pesos ang hospital bill, binayaran po natin ang hospital bill para makauwi po yung kababayan natin may stage 4 cancer at makapiling niya yung pamilya niya in his dying moments kasi nasawi rin po siya sa kinasamaang-palad.

asr-001754
01:46:08.380 --> 01:46:11.360
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But at least nung mga huling sandali niya, huling...

asr-001755
01:46:11.360 --> 01:46:17.380
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: himlayan, kapiling niya yung kanyang pamilya at binayaran natin yung more than 1 million peso hospital bill niya.

asr-001756
01:46:19.100 --> 01:46:30.620
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: Thank you, Mr. Secretary, sa inyong sagot. Kita naman po natin na action fund po ay hindi lang po para sa repatriation kundi malaki din po itong pakinabang po sa healthcare po ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-001757
01:46:31.460 --> 01:46:39.580
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: And kaya naman po dapat supportahan po talaga natin ang pagtaas po ng action fund at ng ERF ng Departamento ng DMW.

asr-001758
01:46:39.880 --> 01:46:50.660
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: At kita din po natin sila po ang mga frontliners, sila po ang sumasagot sa mga saklolo ng ating mga kababayan diyan po sa gera po na kinaharap natin sa Middle East.

asr-001759
01:46:50.880 --> 01:47:04.180
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: And nakakasama po ng loob na nakikita po natin na ultimo po yung sweldo po ng ating mga JOs po dyan po sa OWWA ay hindi pa po tama.

asr-001760
01:47:04.340 --> 01:47:09.980
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: Tama ba na 888 pa kayo, diba? Nakakahiya naman po yun.

asr-001761
01:47:10.040 --> 01:47:12.760
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: And nabisita ko po ang kanilang tanggapan.

asr-001762
01:47:13.120 --> 01:47:15.160
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: Nakita ko po ang kagamitan po nila doon.

asr-001763
01:47:15.960 --> 01:47:26.940
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: Paano ka po makakasagot po sa mga iyak ng mga kababayan natin kung ang kagamitan po nila ay 19 kopong-kopong pa po.

asr-001764
01:47:27.260 --> 01:47:31.980
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: Yung iba po doon napakaluma na para makapagsilbi lang po sa taong bayan,

asr-001765
01:47:32.380 --> 01:47:41.620
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: ang mga empleyado po o mga JO po natin na sumasagot po sa call center po ng OWWA ay gamit po nila ang kanilang personal na kagamitan.

asr-001766
01:47:41.960 --> 01:47:46.240
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: Hindi lang yun, madami na rin po kailangan pagawa din sa kanilang building.

asr-001767
01:47:46.440 --> 01:47:50.580
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: Balita ko po may water feature na po kayo doon na waterfall sa loob po ng inyong building.

asr-001768
01:47:51.180 --> 01:47:53.980
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: And wala na.

asr-001769
01:47:54.740 --> 01:48:05.160
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: So yun po, isa po sa mga kailangan po natin talaga is dagdagan po at bigyan po ng natamang supporta ang Department of Migrant Workers at ang OWWA

asr-001770
01:48:05.160 --> 01:48:12.320
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: dahil yun nga po kailangan po natin pangalagaan ang ating OFWs tulad po ng sabi po ni

asr-001771
01:48:12.320 --> 01:48:17.340
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: Congressman Nazal, kanina na malaki po ang ambag ng ating mga kababayang OFWs

asr-001772
01:48:17.340 --> 01:48:22.360
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: and dapat naman po talaga we need to go the extra mile for these kababayans

asr-001773
01:48:22.360 --> 01:48:27.840
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: who travel across the world para mabigyan po ng kabuhayan ang kanilang mga pamilya.

asr-001774
01:48:27.860 --> 01:48:29.640
Rep. Bryan B. Revilla: Maraming salamat po, Madam Chair, yun lang po.

asr-001775
01:48:33.660 --> 01:48:36.520
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Thank you so much, Honorable Bryan Revilla.

asr-001776
01:48:37.120 --> 01:48:44.200
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Now, from the majority, we recognize Honorable Ditse Tina Pancho.

asr-001777
01:48:44.940 --> 01:48:46.760
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Good afternoon po, Mr. Chair.

asr-001778
01:48:47.340 --> 01:48:52.300
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Mr. Chair, nakita po natin dito na we have hospitals for OFW patients.

asr-001779
01:48:53.060 --> 01:49:00.120
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: So, like in our case po, in Bulacan, we have OFWs po na pag-uwi, may mga sakit.

asr-001780
01:49:00.400 --> 01:49:06.820
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: So, may we know kung ano na po mga hospital na makaka-avail po yung ating mga pasyente?

asr-001781
01:49:06.900 --> 01:49:11.360
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Kasi with DOH, they have list ng government hospitals.

asr-001782
01:49:11.820 --> 01:49:13.960
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: So, do you have the same list with the DOH?

asr-001783
01:49:15.380 --> 01:49:18.400
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yes po, Madam Chair, Madam Congresswoman.

asr-001784
01:49:18.400 --> 01:49:23.340
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Two things po. Una is we have an OFW hospital in San Fernando, Pampanga.

asr-001785
01:49:23.340 --> 01:49:25.740
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: At marami po sa kanila doon ay mga...

asr-001786
01:49:25.740 --> 01:49:28.180
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Mr. Chair, is that JBL or another?

asr-001787
01:49:28.180 --> 01:49:34.420
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: It's another hospital po. It's maybe a few kilometer, less than one kilometer away from JBL.

asr-001788
01:49:35.200 --> 01:49:37.200
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: It's in San Fernando po.

asr-001789
01:49:38.340 --> 01:49:38.900
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And...

asr-001790
01:49:40.400 --> 01:49:40.960
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: OFW.

asr-001791
01:49:40.960 --> 01:49:41.940
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Sindalan, no?

asr-001792
01:49:42.280 --> 01:49:42.840
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Sindalan.

asr-001794
01:49:43.020 --> 01:49:50.100
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And marami po mga Bulacan OFWs na idadala, nakikinabang din po dito.

asr-001795
01:49:51.700 --> 01:49:53.080
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Paano po yung process nun?

asr-001796
01:49:53.140 --> 01:49:55.960
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: The same with DOH, may MOA po sa inyo?

asr-001797
01:49:57.093 --> 01:49:57.970
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kami po ang...

asr-001798
01:49:57.970 --> 01:49:59.820
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Or they have to go there directly, tapos...

asr-001799
01:49:59.960 --> 01:50:06.620
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yes, they can go there directly, ma'am, through our regional office or directly walk in sa hospital.

asr-001800
01:50:06.620 --> 01:50:09.600
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: At tutulungan po namin sila.

asr-001801
01:50:10.300 --> 01:50:13.760
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Meron pong urgent care facility for those needing

asr-001802
01:50:13.760 --> 01:50:14.680
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Emergency care.

asr-001803
01:50:15.000 --> 01:50:16.060
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: May requirements po o...

asr-001804
01:50:17.748 --> 01:50:18.271
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Ma'am...

asr-001805
01:50:18.271 --> 01:50:21.460
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Basta may ID lang sila na they work for...

asr-001806
01:50:21.680 --> 01:50:22.920
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Ma'am, simple lang ang requirement.

asr-001807
01:50:23.400 --> 01:50:30.780
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Basta current or former OFW, hindi na nga ho namin tinitignan, ma'am, gano'ng katagal naging OFW.

asr-001808
01:50:30.820 --> 01:50:34.060
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kahit 2003 lang, halimbawa, tinatanggap po namin.

asr-001809
01:50:34.180 --> 01:50:36.420
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And then, ang dependents po nila, puwede rin po.

asr-001810
01:50:36.680 --> 01:50:42.920
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: By dependents, we mean immediate ascendants, so parents, and then immediate descendants, mga anak.

asr-001811
01:50:43.540 --> 01:50:47.220
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Ano po yung hospital bill nila, fully paid lahat o...

asr-001812
01:50:47.240 --> 01:50:47.700
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yes.

asr-001813
01:50:48.200 --> 01:50:49.460
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Fully paid, ma'am.

asr-001814
01:50:49.600 --> 01:50:54.340
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: By way of example, we have had around 100 childbirths.

asr-001815
01:50:54.960 --> 01:50:56.980
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Mga OFWs po ito na nanganak sa ospital.

asr-001816
01:50:57.620 --> 01:50:59.000
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Libring-libre po lahat.

asr-001817
01:50:59.000 --> 01:51:01.580
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Wala silang sinasagot kahit isang kusing.

asr-001818
01:51:01.760 --> 01:51:05.560
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And then, of course, may outpatient facility, blood work.

asr-001819
01:51:06.280 --> 01:51:11.620
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And then, ang realidad lang po, we are level 2 hospital.

asr-001820
01:51:11.620 --> 01:51:13.680
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So hindi pa ho ganap ang

asr-001821
01:51:13.680 --> 01:51:14.660
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: aming services.

asr-001822
01:51:15.260 --> 01:51:19.740
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, meron pa rin kaming referrals to JBL and other hospitals.

asr-001823
01:51:19.740 --> 01:51:21.380
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: So, sa JBL pa rin po yung...

asr-001824
01:51:21.500 --> 01:51:24.920
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Kasi pag sa JBL, usually, JBL na po sila.

asr-001825
01:51:25.020 --> 01:51:26.980
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: They won't transfer to other hospitals.

asr-001826
01:51:26.980 --> 01:51:34.780
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kapag major na po at wala po doon sa services that we provide,

asr-001827
01:51:34.920 --> 01:51:39.560
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: ang surgery, for instance, then we refer accordingly to JBL.

asr-001828
01:51:39.960 --> 01:51:42.120
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: So, ang facilities, hindi pa po kumpleto?

asr-001830
01:51:43.500 --> 01:51:48.000
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: To the extent that it is a level 2 hospital, kumpleto po, ma'am.

asr-001831
01:51:48.080 --> 01:51:50.960
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Pero hindi nga po talaga pa level 3.

asr-001832
01:51:51.400 --> 01:51:56.540
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Ma'am, can I ask USEC Nikki to also help me respond to the query?

asr-001833
01:51:56.540 --> 01:51:59.800
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: USEC Nikki is the USEC in charge of the hospital.

asr-001834
01:52:00.880 --> 01:52:02.140
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001835
01:52:02.220 --> 01:52:03.580
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: With the permission of the Secretary po.

asr-001836
01:52:03.940 --> 01:52:06.640
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Yung nabanggit po kanina ni Secretary Hans,

asr-001837
01:52:06.840 --> 01:52:10.340
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: papaano pumupunta ang mga OFWs sa OFW hospital.

asr-001838
01:52:10.920 --> 01:52:13.940
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: May mga cases po na tinatawag lang.

asr-001839
01:52:13.940 --> 01:52:14.700
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: po sa amin.

asr-001840
01:52:14.700 --> 01:52:20.420
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then the patient do not have the capacity like pamasahe or hindi makalakad.

asr-001841
01:52:20.460 --> 01:52:23.580
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So, pinapasundo po namin yan ng ambulance po namin.

asr-001842
01:52:24.360 --> 01:52:27.520
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Either from Pampanga po, manggagaling yung ambulance.

asr-001843
01:52:27.520 --> 01:52:31.380
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: O meron din po kami dito sa OWWA at saka po sa DMW.

asr-001844
01:52:31.820 --> 01:52:37.280
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So, iahatid po yung patient sa OFW hospital, urgent care, sa emergency room po.

asr-001845
01:52:37.440 --> 01:52:39.500
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then, i-assess po yan ng doctor.

asr-001846
01:52:39.840 --> 01:52:42.640
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So, may cases po na talagang they have to...

asr-001847
01:52:43.800 --> 01:52:47.520
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: stay at the hospital for complete medical checks po.

asr-001848
01:52:47.640 --> 01:52:51.440
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then, after assessment, kung okay na po siya, ma'am,

asr-001849
01:52:51.500 --> 01:52:53.460
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: ibabalik din po namin siya sa bahay nila.

asr-001850
01:52:53.560 --> 01:52:57.120
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then, there's follow-through by phone po.

asr-001851
01:52:57.600 --> 01:53:01.140
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: In terms po of the services, as mentioned po by the Secretary,

asr-001852
01:53:01.600 --> 01:53:07.120
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: while it's not level 3 yet, may mga cases po na halimbawa,

asr-001853
01:53:07.120 --> 01:53:11.740
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: patient ng OFW hospital, i-refer namin sa JBL.

asr-001854
01:53:11.980 --> 01:53:13.800
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: But in the same manner, dahil we know,

asr-001855
01:53:13.800 --> 01:53:20.380
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: the cases also sa JBL na medyo, ano na rin po, punong-puno.

asr-001856
01:53:20.620 --> 01:53:23.960
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So, pagka po may mga cases na kaya for level 2,

asr-001857
01:53:24.020 --> 01:53:28.540
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: si JBL po, dadalhin naman po sa OFW hospital yung pasyente.

asr-001858
01:53:28.700 --> 01:53:29.700
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So, that's how it works.

asr-001859
01:53:29.900 --> 01:53:34.720
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And zero billing, yes, because we're also supported by PhilHealth,

asr-001860
01:53:34.800 --> 01:53:36.620
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: by MAIPIF, and then OWWA.

asr-001861
01:53:36.780 --> 01:53:40.860
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And yung pondo po mismo ng hospital, yung MOOE po.

asr-001862
01:53:42.000 --> 01:53:43.860
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Ma'am, with all the services that you give,

asr-001863
01:53:43.860 --> 01:53:48.240
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: to the OFWs, nakapagtataka, bakit binabawasan pa kayo?

asr-001864
01:53:49.820 --> 01:53:52.060
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Di ba? Kasi nakakaawa naman po,

asr-001865
01:53:52.060 --> 01:53:56.560
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: kasi yung puro sacrifices na po on the part of the OFWs,

asr-001866
01:53:57.220 --> 01:54:00.560
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: pero hindi nabibigyan ng magandang budget.

asr-001867
01:54:00.660 --> 01:54:02.740
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: So, sana po mapakinggan tayo ng DBM,

asr-001868
01:54:02.740 --> 01:54:07.300
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: para may pagpatuloy po natin yung support natin to our kababayans.

asr-001869
01:54:07.840 --> 01:54:09.220
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Thank you po, Mr. Chair.

asr-001870
01:54:13.220 --> 01:54:17.580
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Thank you so much, Honorable Tina Pancho.

asr-001871
01:54:20.580 --> 01:54:26.320
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Now, we recognize from the majority, Honorable Johanne Bautista.

asr-001872
01:54:27.880 --> 01:54:29.380
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001873
01:54:29.860 --> 01:54:32.600
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Good afternoon po to the Honorable Committee,

asr-001874
01:54:32.900 --> 01:54:36.580
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Sec. Hans, Admin PY, the DMW, and the OWWA families.

asr-001875
01:54:36.760 --> 01:54:37.940
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Magandang hapon po sa inyo.

asr-001876
01:54:38.520 --> 01:54:43.400
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Habang pasan po na ating mga OFW ang paglilingkod at pagsaservisyo sa mundo,

asr-001877
01:54:43.990 --> 01:54:45.860
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: sino po ang nag-aalaga sa kanila?

asr-001878
01:54:46.160 --> 01:54:50.180
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Ito po ang mahalagang papel ng DMW at ng OWA.

asr-001879
01:54:50.360 --> 01:54:54.580
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: The DMW's mandate is to ensure that policy becomes protection

asr-001880
01:54:54.580 --> 01:54:58.160
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: and that protection becomes tangible relief on the ground.

asr-001881
01:54:58.620 --> 01:55:03.760
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Pinatunayan po ito ng DMW at ng OWA, lalo na po noong mga nakaraang buwan.

asr-001882
01:55:03.880 --> 01:55:09.240
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Sa gitna po ng digmaan at panganib na riyan po ang DMW at ang OWA.

asr-001883
01:55:09.340 --> 01:55:15.820
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Hindi po madali ang inyong gawain, and yet you persist with quiet courage and resolve.

asr-001884
01:55:16.160 --> 01:55:19.020
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: At patunay po kayo na ang serbisyo publiko,

asr-001885
01:55:19.020 --> 01:55:22.780
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: ay may puso mapagkalinga at matapang na paninindigan

asr-001886
01:55:22.780 --> 01:55:27.260
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: pagdating po sa pagtatanggol ng karapatan at kapakanan ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-001887
01:55:27.400 --> 01:55:29.880
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Maraming salamat po sa inyong serbisyo.

asr-001888
01:55:30.160 --> 01:55:36.580
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Now, I will be touching on the, I think, yung mga pinaka-importante po

asr-001889
01:55:36.580 --> 01:55:40.500
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: at mga paborito ko pong programa ng DMW at ng OWWA.

asr-001890
01:55:40.500 --> 01:55:44.500
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Specifically po sa Action Fund na lagi pong in action.

asr-001891
01:55:45.080 --> 01:55:49.300
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: We have seen Action Fund in action in many ways, in many times.

asr-001892
01:55:49.580 --> 01:55:51.420
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: At personally, nakita ko po talaga yan.

asr-001893
01:55:51.680 --> 01:55:54.200
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Gusto lang po natin bigyan emphasis on record.

asr-001894
01:55:54.500 --> 01:56:01.460
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Ilan po ba ang naging benepisyaryo so far ng Action Fund for 2026?

asr-001895
01:56:01.740 --> 01:56:10.720
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: And maybe po, Madam Chair, the department can share with us kung ano po ang kanilang magiging pondo so far for 2027.

asr-001896
01:56:10.720 --> 01:56:13.560
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: And sa tingin po ba nila, ay sapat nila ito?

asr-001897
01:56:13.560 --> 01:56:18.840
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: At kung hindi, let's make it of record, ilan po ba ang kailangan po ng DMW to service?

asr-001898
01:56:18.840 --> 01:56:24.660
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: All our Filipino OFWs abroad, hindi lamang po yung nasa gitna po ng Middle East crisis,

asr-001899
01:56:24.660 --> 01:56:30.820
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: kundi pati po yung mga nabibiktima na ating mga, yung mga scam hubs, nasa Asia po yan so far.

asr-001900
01:56:30.820 --> 01:56:34.180
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Ang dami rin po nating kailangan serbisyohan.

asr-001901
01:56:34.180 --> 01:56:37.240
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Maybe we can start po with the Action Fund, Madam Chair.

asr-001902
01:56:39.280 --> 01:56:46.600
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yes, thank you, Madam Chair. Thank you, our dear budget sponsor last year.

asr-001903
01:56:46.600 --> 01:56:49.380
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And congratulations po on your chairship

asr-001904
01:56:49.380 --> 01:56:55.340
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: of the Committee on Social Services as we welcome our new budget sponsor, Madam Chair, Vice Chair.

asr-001905
01:56:56.780 --> 01:57:01.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Doon po sa Action Fund, as you know, it's a legal, medical, and financial assistance fund.

asr-001906
01:57:04.220 --> 01:57:14.660
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Meron po tayong 80,000, as I mentioned, financially assisted, 14,000 OFWs with pending or past legal cases

asr-001907
01:57:14.660 --> 01:57:19.000
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: handled by our law firms and in-house lawyers.

asr-001908
01:57:19.000 --> 01:57:24.660
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And then meron din tayong around 5,000 medical cases na natulungan.

asr-001909
01:57:24.660 --> 01:57:34.940
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: As I said, hindi po natin tinutulungan pagka-covered upon ng insurance at nababayaran ng insurance yung medical coverage nila.

asr-001910
01:57:35.120 --> 01:57:42.700
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Having said this, with your permission, Madam Chair, can I ask Undersecretary Felicitas Bay, who handles the Action Fund, on the details of the budget?

asr-001911
01:57:45.800 --> 01:57:49.760
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: Magandang araw po, Madam Chair, and also to...

asr-001912
01:57:49.760 --> 01:57:53.320
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: Representative Johanne Bautista.

asr-001913
01:57:53.320 --> 01:58:04.120
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: For the Action Fund po, nabanggit na po kanina ni Secretary, doon sa aming financial assistance, only for the period January to July of 2026.

asr-001914
01:58:04.480 --> 01:58:13.160
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: This includes po our data for our migrant workers offices, our regional offices, and also the central office.

asr-001915
01:58:13.160 --> 01:58:19.420
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: Sa financial assistance po ay umabot na po tayo sa mga nabigyan natin at natulungan.

asr-001916
01:58:19.420 --> 01:58:23.460
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: na 44,445 OFWs.

asr-001917
01:58:23.580 --> 01:58:28.600
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: For medical, 1,173.

asr-001918
01:58:28.800 --> 01:58:32.400
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: Legal assistance po ay 2,610.

asr-001919
01:58:33.140 --> 01:58:37.060
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: And for the repatriation, 7,329.

asr-001920
01:58:37.750 --> 01:58:43.840
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: Kasama din po yung ating assistance in welfare cases, 89,891.

asr-001921
01:58:43.920 --> 01:58:47.840
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: Just for the period of January to July 2026,

asr-001922
01:58:48.280 --> 01:58:50.500
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: the total services...

asr-001923
01:58:50.500 --> 01:59:00.060
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: and assistance that we have provided, sourced from the Action Fund, 145,448 po yung ating beneficiaries.

asr-001924
01:59:00.060 --> 01:59:10.920
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: If ang Action Fund po ay nasimula namin ng 2023, and from July 2023 up to July of 2026,

asr-001925
01:59:11.200 --> 01:59:17.840
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: the total assistance and beneficiaries, umabot na po tayo sa 606,921.

asr-001926
01:59:17.840 --> 01:59:20.560
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: I wish also, Ma'am, to emphasize,

asr-001927
01:59:20.700 --> 01:59:22.400
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: aside from the financial assistance,

asr-001928
01:59:22.920 --> 01:59:34.460
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: we also have our legal retainers because of the ongoing legal pending and cases we have in our various posts.

asr-001929
01:59:34.720 --> 01:59:37.220
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: We have 32 legal retainers.

asr-001930
01:59:37.220 --> 01:59:40.940
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: These are the law firms in the respective jurisdiction.

asr-001931
01:59:41.850 --> 01:59:45.720
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: And we have our in-house counsels, labing tatlo po yan.

asr-001932
01:59:45.800 --> 01:59:48.240
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: Sila po ay mga locals.

asr-001933
01:59:48.620 --> 01:59:59.220
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: The lawyers who are employed and who are engaged right at our migrant workers' offices.

asr-001938
02:00:00.050 --> 02:00:02.410
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: So, yun po yung ating mga tinutulungan.

asr-001939
02:00:03.020 --> 02:00:06.120
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: Ganon din po, nabanggit kanina yung medical retainer.

asr-001940
02:00:06.120 --> 02:00:12.420
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: We have existing special medical arrangements in Abu Dhabi, Jordan, in Qatar,

asr-001941
02:00:12.600 --> 02:00:17.260
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: and we have a medical retainer in Dubai.

asr-001942
02:00:17.620 --> 02:00:23.840
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: So, we wish to have more, the engagement of more medical retainers

asr-001943
02:00:23.840 --> 02:00:26.840
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: para po sa ating mga kababayan na nagkakasakit.

asr-001944
02:00:26.840 --> 02:00:35.280
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: Doon po sa medical, halos karamihan po sa ating mga kaso sa Middle East and in Asia Pacific,

asr-001945
02:00:35.540 --> 02:00:43.280
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: yun pong medical na nagkulang sa insurance or the insurance is not sufficient or cannot be covered.

asr-001946
02:00:43.580 --> 02:00:46.920
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: And at the same time, sa Middle East po,

asr-001947
02:00:46.920 --> 02:00:47.440
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: ay yung mga

asr-001948
02:00:47.440 --> 02:00:52.760
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: huroob cases or the undocumented Filipino OFWs,

asr-001949
02:00:52.760 --> 02:00:54.480
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: which is covered by the Action Fund.

asr-001950
02:00:54.480 --> 02:00:59.480
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: As the Honorable Chair and Representative Bautista would know,

asr-001951
02:00:59.660 --> 02:01:07.260
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: ang Action Fund po ay covering documented and undocumented OFWs.

asr-001952
02:01:07.260 --> 02:01:11.720
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: So, we cater to all our OFWs and we don't discriminate.

asr-001953
02:01:12.180 --> 02:01:13.740
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: Magandang hapon po muli, ma'am.

asr-001954
02:01:14.720 --> 02:01:16.320
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Yes, ma'am. Thank you po.

asr-001955
02:01:16.420 --> 02:01:17.420
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Follow-up ko lang po.

asr-001956
02:01:17.420 --> 02:01:23.200
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: So, kung magkano po ba ang Action Fund currently doon po sa NEP?

asr-001957
02:01:23.200 --> 02:01:25.920
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: And if based on your assessment, sapat na po ba?

asr-001958
02:01:26.020 --> 02:01:30.560
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: And kung kailangan po, sa tingin niyo po ay hindi sapat, magkano pa po ba ang kulang?

asr-001959
02:01:30.560 --> 02:01:33.760
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Sa tingin niyo, maybe we can justify ngayon po and make it of record.

asr-001960
02:01:33.960 --> 02:01:34.540
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Salamat po.

asr-001961
02:01:36.680 --> 02:01:40.840
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: Ma'am, sa NEP po ay 2 billion yung sa ating Action Fund.

asr-001962
02:01:41.200 --> 02:01:46.760
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: At kung kami po ay hihiling, at ito po ay additional 1 billion po.

asr-001963
02:01:48.100 --> 02:01:54.680
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: So, can we explain bakit po natin nire-request yung additional 1 billion fund?

asr-001964
02:01:54.680 --> 02:01:57.700
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: I believe last year po, 2 billion po ang naibigay.

asr-001965
02:01:57.700 --> 02:02:00.460
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Nakita po natin malinaw, kulang na kulang po yan.

asr-001966
02:02:00.460 --> 02:02:01.560
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Kaya po nagkaroon ng supplemental.

asr-001967
02:02:01.560 --> 02:02:03.580
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Maraming salamat po kay President.

asr-001968
02:02:03.580 --> 02:02:05.900
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Pero hopefully, hindi po kailanganin.

asr-001969
02:02:05.900 --> 02:02:11.920
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: But at the rate that you've seen when we have to respond into emergency crisis such as that,

asr-001970
02:02:11.920 --> 02:02:17.760
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: maybe meron po tayong justification bakit po 1 billion ang additional na hinihiling po natin.

asr-001971
02:02:18.520 --> 02:02:27.720
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: Yes, ma'am, the NEP is for 2 billion and ang kahilingan po ng ating Departamento ay an additional of 1 billion

asr-001972
02:02:27.720 --> 02:02:33.760
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: to cover welfare assistance, financial, medical, repatriation, and our legal assistance.

asr-001973
02:02:35.060 --> 02:02:43.720
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: Gusto din po namin sanang matapatan or if it can be equivalent or corresponding to what the President has given,

asr-001974
02:02:43.720 --> 02:02:45.780
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: the additional 3 billion fund.

asr-001975
02:02:45.780 --> 02:02:54.580
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: Which is to answer and to help us manage with the ongoing geopolitical crisis,

asr-001976
02:02:54.580 --> 02:03:05.380
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: which also not covers only the land base because we also have a lot of seafaring concerns affecting our sea-based workers

asr-001977
02:03:05.380 --> 02:03:10.240
DMW Undersecretary Felicitas Q. Bay: and other concerns affecting our Filipino workers.

asr-001978
02:03:11.280 --> 02:03:13.520
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Yes, ma'am. Thank you, ma'am. Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001979
02:03:13.520 --> 02:03:15.840
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: And I would like to manifest my support.

asr-001980
02:03:15.840 --> 02:03:19.460
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: For the requested increase of the DMW for the 1 billion.

asr-001981
02:03:19.460 --> 02:03:25.580
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: And we know na ito pong Action Fund is always in action and always needs the resources they need.

asr-001982
02:03:25.580 --> 02:03:30.860
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Na riyan po, mararamdaman po agad ng ating mga kababayan na malayo po sa atin.

asr-001983
02:03:30.940 --> 02:03:36.780
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Now, in relation to that, meron din po parang ganitong pondo ang OWA, ang ERF,

asr-001984
02:03:36.780 --> 02:03:41.980
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: na nalulungkot po tayong marinig, na nabawasan po, nabalitaan po natin.

asr-001985
02:03:41.980 --> 02:03:45.820
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: And maybe the OWA Administrator can confirm, Madam Chair,

asr-001986
02:03:45.820 --> 02:03:48.220
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: na nabawasan po ang kanilang ERF.

asr-001987
02:03:48.220 --> 02:03:57.000
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: And maybe the OWA can explain ano po ba ang acceptable level of funding for our ERF

asr-001988
02:03:57.000 --> 02:04:00.780
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: and yung mga beneficiaries po natin, ang services natin,

asr-001989
02:04:00.800 --> 02:04:05.840
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: and ano po sa tingin po nila ang acceptable level of the ERF funding, Madam Chair.

asr-001990
02:04:05.980 --> 02:04:06.440
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Thank you po.

asr-001991
02:04:07.240 --> 02:04:15.140
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Madam Chair, of course, our dear former budget sponsor, maraming maraming salamat po.

asr-001992
02:04:15.200 --> 02:04:22.460
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Yung adbokasiya niyo po talaga para sa ating mga OFWs tuloy-tuloy po, Madam Chair.

asr-001993
02:04:22.740 --> 02:04:25.120
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: At maraming salamat po.

asr-001994
02:04:25.320 --> 02:04:31.280
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: At for the record po, nagpapasalamat po kami talaga kay Congresswoman Bautista.

asr-001995
02:04:31.340 --> 02:04:35.840
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Talaga po nag-immerse siya doon sa operations ng parehong DEMW at OWA.

asr-001996
02:04:35.840 --> 02:04:43.120
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: At kitang-kita po doon sa kanyang komento, pareho po sila ni Kong Bryan Revilla

asr-001997
02:04:43.120 --> 02:04:45.360
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: na aming pong dinala.

asr-001998
02:04:45.360 --> 02:04:48.040
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: sa lahat po ng aming mga iba't ibang programa.

asr-001999
02:04:48.040 --> 02:04:52.320
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: At nakita pa nga ni Kong Revilla, hindi niya makalimutan siguro,

asr-002000
02:04:52.320 --> 02:04:57.180
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: yung lumang-lumang mga computer na ngayon po dahan-dahan at napapalitan na po.

asr-002001
02:04:57.260 --> 02:04:58.820
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Kong Brian, maraming salamat.

asr-002002
02:05:00.300 --> 02:05:03.280
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Regarding the Emergency Repatriation Fund,

asr-002003
02:05:04.120 --> 02:05:10.080
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: nasabi ko na po, tatlong taon na nasa 1.2 billion po ang level po nito.

asr-002004
02:05:10.080 --> 02:05:15.060
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Ngayon po sa NEP natin, nasa 900 million na lamang po.

asr-002005
02:05:15.060 --> 02:05:19.520
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Kahit na nasa kaligitnaan pa rin tayo ng isang geopolitical crisis.

asr-002006
02:05:20.340 --> 02:05:29.700
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Itong taon lang po itong mismo, 1.6 billion na po ang nagastos ng OWA sa repatriation-related expenses.

asr-002007
02:05:30.720 --> 02:05:36.000
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Madam Chair, isa pong numero na bago kong sasabihin, to put on record, Madam Chair,

asr-002008
02:05:37.180 --> 02:05:45.780
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: the Emergency Repatriation Fund has served already 139,688 OFW clients.

asr-002009
02:05:45.780 --> 02:05:49.500
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: As of July 31 of this year.

asr-002010
02:05:49.520 --> 02:05:58.320
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: At the rate we're going, Madam Chair, we will finish as forecasted, around 240 to 250,000 clients.

asr-002011
02:05:59.120 --> 02:06:04.740
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: And we are thankful to the President, and of course, the support of Congress as well,

asr-002012
02:06:04.740 --> 02:06:10.240
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: and the Department of Budget and Management for the additional 700 million supplemental.

asr-002013
02:06:11.440 --> 02:06:14.580
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Madam Chair, kami po ay tumatakbo na lang dun sa supplemental.

asr-002014
02:06:15.140 --> 02:06:17.560
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Ubus na po ang continuing from last year.

asr-002015
02:06:17.660 --> 02:06:20.060
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Ubus na po ang 1.2.

asr-002016
02:06:20.120 --> 02:06:25.360
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: At ngayon po, ay dun na po kami tumatakbo dun sa dagdag na pondo.

asr-002017
02:06:26.120 --> 02:06:32.940
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Ang malaki yung concern namin dito, ay isa pa lang po yung crisis.

asr-002018
02:06:33.960 --> 02:06:44.820
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Dun sa regional crisis na yun, ay nakita po natin na ang pondo ng DMW at OWA ay pwedeng sa loob ng tatlo hanggang anim na buwan maubos agad.

asr-002019
02:06:45.100 --> 02:06:49.460
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: So, depende sa kung gaano kadami ang apektado pong OFWs.

asr-002020
02:06:50.400 --> 02:06:53.320
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Madam Chair, gusto po namin maging handa.

asr-002021
02:06:53.860 --> 02:06:58.580
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Handa para magbigay ng serbisyo kung ano man pong kaguluhan ang mangyari.

asr-002022
02:06:59.140 --> 02:07:06.240
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Sa aming pong pananaw, ang hinihiling po namin, Madam Chair, at the minimum, ma-restore at 1.2.

asr-002023
02:07:06.240 --> 02:07:12.660
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Ngunit, ang hinihingi po namin, base dun sa aming sulat na ipinadala po sa ating mahal na speaker,

asr-002024
02:07:12.660 --> 02:07:15.060
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: is an additional 575

asr-002025
02:07:15.060 --> 02:07:20.140
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: million to the 900 plus million.

asr-002026
02:07:20.980 --> 02:07:27.080
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Para po, kami po ay nasa a little bit below the 1.5 billion mark.

asr-002027
02:07:27.320 --> 02:07:33.100
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Napaka-importante po na parehong action fund at ERF ang may pondo.

asr-002028
02:07:33.100 --> 02:07:37.960
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Kasi meron pong mga gastos na hindi po pwedeng bayaran ng ERF.

asr-002029
02:07:37.960 --> 02:07:42.240
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: At meron pong mga gastos na pang action fund po talaga siya.

asr-002030
02:07:42.320 --> 02:07:50.320
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: So, meron po kaming complimentary po yan para whole package po ang serbisyo namin para sa OFWs, Madam Chair.

asr-002031
02:07:50.440 --> 02:08:00.220
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: So, ang hiling po namin is an additional 575 million po para po sa emergency repatriation fund po, Madam Chair.

asr-002032
02:08:01.760 --> 02:08:03.300
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Thank you po, Madam Chair.

asr-002033
02:08:03.300 --> 02:08:12.100
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: And in relation to that, I also manifest my strong support for the return of at least the minimum of 1.2 billion ng ERF.

asr-002034
02:08:12.260 --> 02:08:16.780
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: At kung maaari pa po ay the few hundred million na nire-request po ng OWA.

asr-002035
02:08:16.780 --> 02:08:22.300
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Dahil nakikita naman po natin, diretsyo naman po sa tao ang pinupuntahan ng mga pondong yan.

asr-002036
02:08:22.300 --> 02:08:29.480
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: At pagka po yan ay nababawasan kasi meron pa rin pong mga lugar na kailangan pa rin pong pagserbisyohan.

asr-002037
02:08:29.480 --> 02:08:31.900
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Baka po mawalan sila ng allocation for that.

asr-002038
02:08:31.900 --> 02:08:36.540
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Now, lastly na lang po, given the limited time, andami po, na-mention po yung immersion.

asr-002039
02:08:36.540 --> 02:08:42.020
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Lahat po yan, yung mga shelter, yung mga serbisyo ng ano,

asr-002040
02:08:42.020 --> 02:08:44.140
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Nakita po natin lahat yan, totoo po talaga.

asr-002041
02:08:44.140 --> 02:08:50.660
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: That's why I express my very strong support for the increase for the funds of Action Fund and the ERF.

asr-002042
02:08:50.660 --> 02:08:58.780
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Now, pagka po tayo ay nagre-rescue, nagre-repatriate, hindi po natatapos doon ang serbisyon ng DMW at ng ating gobyerno.

asr-002043
02:08:58.780 --> 02:09:02.580
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Napaka-importante po, lalo na po sa amin, ang reintegration program.

asr-002044
02:09:02.920 --> 02:09:09.400
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: I think na-touch up pa na po yan kanina, but we also just want to check on the funding of the reintegration program.

asr-002045
02:09:09.560 --> 02:09:11.780
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Hindi po kasi po pwede na uuwi lang.

asr-002046
02:09:11.780 --> 02:09:19.220
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Sila dito, gusto po natin, sila ay panatag pa rin pagbalik nila dito, whether babalik sila abroad or mapapanatili na dito.

asr-002047
02:09:19.460 --> 02:09:23.820
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Ano po ba ang mga serbisyo nito? Magkano po ang pondo? Sapat po ba?

asr-002048
02:09:23.960 --> 02:09:29.580
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: At kung hindi po ay maybe we can make it of record na rin po, and we can justify it po.

asr-002049
02:09:29.680 --> 02:09:30.620
Rep. Johanne Monich G. Bautista: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-002050
02:09:31.180 --> 02:09:37.280
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: With your permission, Madam Chair, I will start things off.

asr-002051
02:09:37.360 --> 02:09:41.260
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But we have our Assistant Secretary for Reintegration here who can supply the details.

asr-002052
02:09:41.580 --> 02:09:48.040
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But essentially, ang framework po natin, kalinga, kaalaman, kabuhayan, at kaagapay.

asr-002053
02:09:48.140 --> 02:09:53.160
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, yung kalinga is yung psychosocial welfare side sa mga nanunumbalik.

asr-002054
02:09:53.200 --> 02:09:57.900
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: As I mentioned, when you speak of the U.S.-Israel-Iran war,

asr-002055
02:09:58.510 --> 02:10:01.940
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: mismo si Presidente, nung sumalubong sa mga nanumbalik,

asr-002056
02:10:02.560 --> 02:10:05.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: nagtanong at may mga nagkwento, iba pa nga sa kanila, mga bata,

asr-002057
02:10:05.960 --> 02:10:10.480
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: na nakadinig ng pagyanig ng lupa, ng bahay,

asr-002058
02:10:10.480 --> 02:10:17.500
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: kapag merong falling debris ng projectiles or missile attacks na nainkwentro sila sa host country,

asr-002059
02:10:17.680 --> 02:10:21.640
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: sa kasagsagan ng hidwaan.

asr-002060
02:10:22.700 --> 02:10:24.680
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, that's the kalinga portion.

asr-002061
02:10:24.980 --> 02:10:29.860
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And since that time, around 6,000 had been provided this particular welfare assistance,

asr-002062
02:10:30.140 --> 02:10:33.080
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: psychosocial counseling, and other welfare interventions.

asr-002063
02:10:33.460 --> 02:10:39.500
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yung kaalaman is yung skills training interventions with DG Kiko Benitez.

asr-002064
02:10:39.740 --> 02:10:45.320
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, mga also, nearly around 5,000 naman po nabigyan ng serbisyo along these lines.

asr-002065
02:10:45.320 --> 02:10:47.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yung mga nanumbalik para mag-retool, mag-retrain.

asr-002066
02:10:47.940 --> 02:10:52.700
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Halimbawa, domestic worker who were 30% of those who returned,

asr-002067
02:10:53.420 --> 02:10:58.220
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: binigyan ng bagong panimula by way of a barista training sa TESDA.

asr-002068
02:10:58.220 --> 02:11:03.360
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Para siya naman ay hindi lamang domestic worker, kundi maging barista sa isang coffee shop or restaurant.

asr-002069
02:11:04.040 --> 02:11:08.280
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, meron pong ganitong efforts, 5,000 ay nabiyayaan along these lines.

asr-002070
02:11:08.480 --> 02:11:10.280
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And then, meron pong kabuhayan.

asr-002071
02:11:10.480 --> 02:11:16.620
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: In the first semester, mga higit kumulang 2,000 ang nakapag-avail ng capital assistance,

asr-002072
02:11:17.200 --> 02:11:23.340
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: not just from DMW OWA, but other agencies such as DTI, DOT, and DA Agriculture.

asr-002073
02:11:23.340 --> 02:11:28.920
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Merong kaagapay, kasi ang ibig sabihin naman ng kaagapay, so 4Ks po ito, no?

asr-002074
02:11:28.920 --> 02:11:35.320
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yung pang-apat na K is kaagapay, kasi si Pangulong Marcos, bago pa nangyari itong sigalot,

asr-002075
02:11:35.320 --> 02:11:38.180
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: binuklod na kaming lahat na government agencies.

asr-002076
02:11:38.180 --> 02:11:40.420
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: into a national reintegration network.

asr-002077
02:11:41.400 --> 02:11:49.020
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kaya nakita na po ni Presidente na hindi lamang DMW-OWWA, but obviously other government agencies

asr-002078
02:11:49.020 --> 02:11:55.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: should provide the necessary assistance by way of re-employment, livelihood, or retooling or reskilling.

asr-002079
02:11:56.700 --> 02:12:05.320
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: For the details dun sa budget, the good news is for the first time during your time in the President's term

asr-002080
02:12:05.320 --> 02:12:07.160
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: and this particular Congress.

asr-002081
02:12:07.620 --> 02:12:14.220
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, naging nine figures in the 100 million.

asr-002082
02:12:14.220 --> 02:12:20.520
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, maniwala po kayo't hindi, below 100 million lang dati ang MOOE ng National Reintegration Center.

asr-002083
02:12:20.820 --> 02:12:26.580
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: At hindi lamang po tumuntong ng nine figures, kundi 300 million na po ang incoming budget sa NEP

asr-002084
02:12:26.580 --> 02:12:29.360
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: ng MOOE ng National Reintegration Center.

asr-002085
02:12:29.360 --> 02:12:35.340
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: However, humihingi pa po kami ng additional 300 para tuluyan maging ganap.

asr-002086
02:12:35.360 --> 02:12:37.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kasi yung binabanggit po kanina, pangangailangan,

asr-002087
02:12:37.880 --> 02:12:46.440
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: sa crisis, also includes, para sa mga nasa abroad, also includes crisis interventions sa kanilang panumbalik.

asr-002088
02:12:46.440 --> 02:12:51.440
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, with your permission, Madam Chair, can I request Asec. Kiko de Guzman

asr-002089
02:12:51.440 --> 02:13:02.180
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: to give the necessary details dun sa hinihiling pa naming budget intervention or karagdagan dito sa House.

asr-002090
02:13:05.480 --> 02:13:10.960
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: With the permission of the Secretary, thank you very much to the members of the Committee,

asr-002091
02:13:11.940 --> 02:13:18.480
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: Doon po sa kasalukuyan, binigyan na po kami ng, ang binibigay po sa amin is 309 million.

asr-002092
02:13:19.460 --> 02:13:25.100
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: We're projecting approximately 51,000 beneficiaries, both OFW and OFW families.

asr-002093
02:13:25.580 --> 02:13:32.040
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: And then doon naman po sa karagdagang hiling namin would be 321 million,

asr-002094
02:13:32.140 --> 02:13:36.280
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: roughly the same number din po ng beneficiary count ang ina-expect.

asr-002095
02:13:37.080 --> 02:13:38.840
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: For context po, Madam Chair,

asr-002096
02:13:39.140 --> 02:13:40.800
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: it is, I believe,

asr-002097
02:13:40.840 --> 02:13:43.360
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: in this same room last November

asr-002098
02:13:43.360 --> 02:13:46.840
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: when we were deliberating the bagong Balikbayan Bill

asr-002099
02:13:46.840 --> 02:13:50.980
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: na members of the House actually humirit po sa DMW.

asr-002100
02:13:51.020 --> 02:13:54.920
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: Ang sabi po ng iba nating mga kagalang-galang na kongresista,

asr-002101
02:13:54.960 --> 02:13:57.380
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: ang sabi nila, parang ang hina naman yata

asr-002102
02:13:57.580 --> 02:14:01.200
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: yung magbigay at magbalik ng benepisyo

asr-002103
02:14:01.200 --> 02:14:03.600
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: para doon sa mga OFW natin.

asr-002104
02:14:03.600 --> 02:14:07.120
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: At that time po, ang livelihood assistance po ng DMW

asr-002105
02:14:07.120 --> 02:14:08.900
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: is pegged at 10,000.

asr-002106
02:14:09.420 --> 02:14:12.680
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: So medyo ang hirit pa nga noon, ano ba yan?

asr-002107
02:14:12.680 --> 02:14:15.980
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: Sabi nila, parang namang for what they actually give

asr-002108
02:14:15.980 --> 02:14:17.480
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: to the national economy,

asr-002109
02:14:17.780 --> 02:14:20.800
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: they are expected to start a livelihood

asr-002110
02:14:20.800 --> 02:14:22.720
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: back in the Philippines for 10,000.

asr-002111
02:14:23.540 --> 02:14:24.920
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: Pinakinggan po namin iyon,

asr-002112
02:14:24.920 --> 02:14:28.880
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: as early as January and February of this year,

asr-002113
02:14:29.020 --> 02:14:32.260
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: tinaas po namin ng bahagya to 15,000.

asr-002114
02:14:32.260 --> 02:14:36.060
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: Although, ideally po sana gusto namin gawing 20,000

asr-002115
02:14:36.060 --> 02:14:39.120
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: yung panimula sa pagbabalik po ng mga OFW.

asr-002116
02:14:39.400 --> 02:14:41.440
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: We have already built the database.

asr-002117
02:14:42.100 --> 02:14:46.180
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: We're ready to roll out fully sa mga nagbabalik pong OFW

asr-002118
02:14:46.180 --> 02:14:49.900
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: within the last year or so ng kanilang pagbabalik dito.

asr-002119
02:14:50.080 --> 02:14:53.480
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: At humihiling lamang po kami ng tulong.

asr-002120
02:14:53.480 --> 02:14:54.660
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: sa Kongreso

asr-002121
02:14:54.660 --> 02:14:56.740
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: at sa Senado na rin kung paano

asr-002122
02:14:56.740 --> 02:14:58.660
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: po mas mabibigyan

asr-002123
02:14:58.660 --> 02:15:00.520
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: ng pagkakataon ng ating mga kababayang

asr-002124
02:15:00.520 --> 02:15:02.480
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: OFW. The programs are already

asr-002125
02:15:02.480 --> 02:15:04.520
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: there, Your Honors.

asr-002126
02:15:04.760 --> 02:15:06.460
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: And we again

asr-002127
02:15:06.460 --> 02:15:08.080
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: thank the House for

asr-002128
02:15:08.080 --> 02:15:10.480
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: the passage of the bagong

asr-002129
02:15:10.480 --> 02:15:12.180
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: Balikbayan Bill. Sana po anytime

asr-002130
02:15:12.180 --> 02:15:14.340
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: within the year, the Senate version

asr-002131
02:15:14.340 --> 02:15:16.440
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: would also be passing. So

asr-002132
02:15:16.440 --> 02:15:18.720
DMW Assistant Secretary Francis Ron C. De Guzman: ito po ay nakatuon sa OFW

