asr-002926
02:44:51.320 --> 02:44:51.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na biktima.

asr-002927
02:44:51.860 --> 02:44:53.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: rin ng trafficking.

asr-002928
02:44:54.280 --> 02:44:58.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano po yung mga efforts na may kinalaman dito?

asr-002929
02:44:58.160 --> 02:45:02.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At saan natin kinukuha yung pondo para mapalakas ang programang ito?

asr-002930
02:45:03.900 --> 02:45:06.280
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Madam Chair, Madam Congresswoman, yes.

asr-002931
02:45:06.460 --> 02:45:11.300
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Karugtong po ng pasasalamat namin sa DFA,

asr-002932
02:45:11.860 --> 02:45:15.060
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: kay Sec. Tes. Lazaro at sa mga ambassadors natin

asr-002933
02:45:15.100 --> 02:45:18.320
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: ay pasasalamat din sa host countries.

asr-002934
02:45:18.720 --> 02:45:21.960
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kasi ganoon na lamang din sa Cambodia, Thailand or Myanmar

asr-002935
02:45:22.100 --> 02:45:24.380
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: ang tulong nila sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-002936
02:45:24.620 --> 02:45:31.460
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: By way of example, galing lang po ako sa Phnom Penh almost two months ago

asr-002937
02:45:31.460 --> 02:45:35.400
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: at nagbukas nga ako kami ng Migrant Workers Office doon

asr-002938
02:45:35.400 --> 02:45:44.220
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: at nakamitting ko po ang Labor Minister ng Cambodia.

asr-002939
02:45:44.920 --> 02:45:47.620
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: At ang layunin po natin doon ay una,

asr-002940
02:45:47.660 --> 02:45:48.480
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: magpasalamat sa

asr-002941
02:45:48.480 --> 02:45:50.680
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: tulong sa mga workers natin sa Cambodia

asr-002942
02:45:50.680 --> 02:45:54.240
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: but also yung layunin natin magkaroon ng labor cooperation agreement

asr-002943
02:45:54.240 --> 02:45:57.040
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: with Cambodia.

asr-002944
02:45:57.040 --> 02:46:01.700
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So this is an example of the kind of effort that we are undertaking.

asr-002945
02:46:02.140 --> 02:46:08.440
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Meron din po tayong current effort toward the November Summit ng ASEAN

asr-002946
02:46:08.440 --> 02:46:11.220
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: in relation to fair and ethical recruitment

asr-002947
02:46:11.220 --> 02:46:16.020
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: amongst the ASEAN leaders, a statement along these lines.

asr-002948
02:46:16.020 --> 02:46:18.440
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Pero hindi ko po muna i-disclose ang full details.

asr-002949
02:46:18.440 --> 02:46:22.660
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Because I will be preempting the President's own announcement along these lines.

asr-002950
02:46:22.920 --> 02:46:28.260
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Dahil sa November Summit po napipinto itong klaseng effort across ASEAN.

asr-002951
02:46:28.280 --> 02:46:30.940
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So meron din pong effort across ASEAN.

asr-002952
02:46:30.940 --> 02:46:35.180
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So the short answer, Madam Chair or Madam Congresswoman,

asr-002953
02:46:35.360 --> 02:46:40.800
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: is along bilateral and regional lines, meron po tayong effort sa larangan na ito.

asr-002954
02:46:40.860 --> 02:46:47.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: At pasalamat po kami sa mga relevant ASEAN states, AMS, member states.

asr-002955
02:46:48.200 --> 02:46:51.820
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Sa kanilang pagbigay ng protection sa ating kababayan.

asr-002956
02:46:52.600 --> 02:46:54.240
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Maraming salamat, Madam Chair.

asr-002957
02:46:54.240 --> 02:46:58.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Totoo po, kailangan talaga ng mas pinalakas na cross-border effort pagdating dito.

asr-002958
02:46:58.760 --> 02:47:02.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lalong-lalo na ang action din mismo ng Kongreso.

asr-002959
02:47:02.040 --> 02:47:06.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi meron naman tayong mga parliamentary diplomatic channels

asr-002960
02:47:06.360 --> 02:47:09.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na pwede rin po natin makausap yung mga counterparts natin

asr-002961
02:47:09.820 --> 02:47:14.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa iba't-ibang mga Kongreso at Parlamento para matugunan agad ang issue na ito.

asr-002962
02:47:14.500 --> 02:47:17.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kasaman po ang boses ng mga kababaihan.

asr-002963
02:47:17.880 --> 02:47:24.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para itulak ang pagdadagdag ng pondo para dun sa nakaranas ng malalaking kaltas.

asr-002964
02:47:24.920 --> 02:47:30.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil Madam Chair, hindi po makatarungan na sa panahon pa ng patong-patong na krisis

asr-002965
02:47:30.380 --> 02:47:37.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay mababawasan pa ang pondo ng ating mga frontliners na tumutulong sa ating mga distressed OFWs

asr-002966
02:47:37.500 --> 02:47:40.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at mga nangangailangan na Pilipino sa ibang bansa.

asr-002967
02:47:41.470 --> 02:47:47.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, Madam Chair, nabanggit niyo kanina na kailangan niyo sana ng dagdag na suporta

asr-002968
02:47:47.500 --> 02:47:52.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa mga retainers sa medical field, para sa AKSYON Fund.

asr-002969
02:47:52.340 --> 02:47:56.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon po ba meron na kayong mga existing na mga personnel para rito?

asr-002970
02:47:57.740 --> 02:48:07.340
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Sa ngayon po, meron tayong medical assistance provided by retainers in selected posts.

asr-002971
02:48:08.080 --> 02:48:10.100
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Admittedly, hindi pa ho ganap.

asr-002972
02:48:10.100 --> 02:48:17.160
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: What we have are partnerships with medical institutions like hospitals in the host countries.

asr-002973
02:48:18.840 --> 02:48:24.340
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: However, yung formal partnership, the way we have a legal retainership with law firms,

asr-002974
02:48:24.440 --> 02:48:27.040
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: ito yung binabanggit ni Admin PY kanina, yun yung kailangan.

asr-002975
02:48:27.040 --> 02:48:33.960
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But right now, the standout post here would be Dubai.

asr-002976
02:48:34.180 --> 02:48:46.340
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Our Dubai post with around 700,000 Filipino workers would have a partnership with a particular clinic.

asr-002977
02:48:47.560 --> 02:48:52.280
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: medical institution that provides such medical services.

asr-002978
02:48:52.880 --> 02:48:58.480
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Pero yun nga po, admittedly, kaya tamang-tama yung binabanggit ni Admin PY kanina,

asr-002979
02:48:58.540 --> 02:49:06.340
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: na kailangan pang palaganapin itong medical retainership similar to our legal retainership agreements

asr-002980
02:49:06.580 --> 02:49:12.100
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: para hayag at sigurado ang matatakbuhan ng ating mga OFWs.

asr-002981
02:49:14.800 --> 02:49:16.080
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Madam Chair?

asr-002982
02:49:16.340 --> 02:49:17.760
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: With the permission of the Secretary,

asr-002983
02:49:18.340 --> 02:49:26.180
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: equally important, if not more important, is the health, medical retainership.

asr-002984
02:49:27.300 --> 02:49:32.520
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Itinutulak po natin din, Madam Chair, napaka-importante po dahil nakikita din namin

asr-002985
02:49:32.520 --> 02:49:44.180
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: ang tumataas din pong mga kaso nang meron pong mental health conditions among our dear OFWs.

asr-002986
02:49:44.180 --> 02:49:46.580
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Ang base po sa feedback,

asr-002987
02:49:46.580 --> 02:49:53.000
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: ng ating mga welfare officers abroad ay importante at kailangan sa ibang post po,

asr-002988
02:49:53.000 --> 02:49:55.520
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: dahil nga alam namin po limitado,

asr-002989
02:49:55.520 --> 02:50:01.620
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: ang retainership din po ng mga psychologists or psychiatrists.

asr-002990
02:50:01.620 --> 02:50:09.600
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Lalong-lalo na po, sa araw-araw po natin pag-uusap sa ating mga distress workers,

asr-002991
02:50:09.600 --> 02:50:15.800
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: marami po sa kanila ang kailangan, hindi lamang po ng consultation, pati po yung medication.

asr-002992
02:50:15.800 --> 02:50:23.540
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Madam Chair, meron na pong efforts ang DMW at OWA patungkol sa, for example,

asr-002993
02:50:23.540 --> 02:50:28.720
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: as said by our Secretary, partnerships. Meron din po tayong telemedicine efforts.

asr-002994
02:50:29.100 --> 02:50:36.680
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Pero sa pananaw po natin, wala pa rin tatalo sa person-to-person po, di ba po, na konsultasyon

asr-002995
02:50:36.680 --> 02:50:42.040
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: para po sa mga professionals na licensed po sa iba't-ibang mga bansa.

asr-002996
02:50:42.040 --> 02:50:45.900
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Para po ma-take advantage po natin.

asr-002997
02:50:45.900 --> 02:50:46.240
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: ng full

asr-002998
02:50:46.240 --> 02:50:50.740
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: array of services, medical services para sa ating pong mga kababayan.

asr-002999
02:50:51.240 --> 02:50:58.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, magkano po yung proposed funding para sa serbisyong ito ng DMW ng OWA?

asr-003000
02:50:58.560 --> 02:51:05.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nais po natin malaman kasi syempre, ang laking tulong po ng mga partnerships natin sa mga CSOs, NGOs,

asr-003001
02:51:06.360 --> 02:51:13.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: iba pang private partners, pero nangangailangan pa rin pala, nangangailangan pa din ng dagdag na pondo

asr-003002
02:51:13.800 --> 02:51:17.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mula sa ating public resources.

asr-003003
02:51:17.640 --> 02:51:25.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lalong-lalo na, Madam Chair, ang nangangailangan ng mga stress debriefing efforts and services.

asr-003004
02:51:25.180 --> 02:51:33.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang naman po yung ating mga distressed OFWs, maski po mismo yung mga manggagawa natin sa DMW, sa OWA,

asr-003005
02:51:33.180 --> 02:51:41.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lahat po ng mga frontliners na tumutulong, maski po sila, nangangailangan din ng mga critical incident stress debriefing.

asr-003006
02:51:41.060 --> 02:51:46.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil hindi po biro ang hinaharap po nila na pagpoproseso ng iba't ibang...

asr-003009
02:51:46.660 --> 02:51:52.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kaso, marami po dito matinding abuso na nararanasan ng ating mga OFWs.

asr-003010
02:51:52.840 --> 02:52:04.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi yan po ang nakita natin, no, na habang tumutulong po tayo sa iba, nakakaligtaan po natin yung tulong din po para doon sa mga frontliners natin na humaharap sa ganitong tipo ng mga situations.

asr-003011
02:52:06.580 --> 02:52:08.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat po, Madam Chair.

asr-003012
02:52:09.600 --> 02:52:15.900
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: On the part of OWA po, Madam Chair, kasi meron din po, of course, under the action fund sa DMW,

asr-003013
02:52:17.920 --> 02:52:20.560
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: magkatuwang naman po kami na frontliners.

asr-003014
02:52:21.140 --> 02:52:28.600
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Meron po kaming tinatawag na very high priority pagdating po sa medical retainership po naming proposal.

asr-003015
02:52:29.140 --> 02:52:31.980
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Ito po ay sa mga following posts.

asr-003016
02:52:32.240 --> 02:52:34.220
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Sa Riyadh, Saudi Arabia po.

asr-003017
02:52:34.380 --> 02:52:38.220
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Sa Abu Dhabi at sa Dubai, United Arab Emirates.

asr-003018
02:52:38.360 --> 02:52:39.560
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Sa Kuwait po.

asr-003019
02:52:39.680 --> 02:52:41.100
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Sa Doha, Qatar.

asr-003020
02:52:42.240 --> 02:52:45.360
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Pagdating naman po sa high priority,

asr-003021
02:52:45.720 --> 02:52:47.800
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: nakalagay po rito ang Singapore,

asr-003022
02:52:49.040 --> 02:52:51.200
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Taipei, Jeddah, Saudi Arabia,

asr-003023
02:52:51.740 --> 02:52:53.580
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Al Khobar at Bahrain.

asr-003024
02:52:54.400 --> 02:52:58.980
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Of course, Madam Chair, we will work within the budget that will be given to us.

asr-003025
02:53:00.040 --> 02:53:05.800
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Humihingi po kami on the part of OWA ng additional po na nasa 130 million.

asr-003026
02:53:06.080 --> 02:53:09.800
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Ito po ay susuporta sa medical and health retainer.

asr-003027
02:53:09.800 --> 02:53:14.860
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: And kasama na po, Madam Chair, ang additional legal retainer.

asr-003028
02:53:14.860 --> 02:53:21.320
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Dahil dumadami rin po talaga ang kailangan ng tulong legal.

asr-003029
02:53:21.320 --> 02:53:24.140
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: At iba-iba po kasi.

asr-003030
02:53:24.140 --> 02:53:25.880
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Meron mga labor cases po.

asr-003031
02:53:25.980 --> 02:53:30.780
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Meron pong mga criminal cases, civil cases or commercial cases.

asr-003032
02:53:31.120 --> 02:53:34.480
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Kung saan tumutulong po kami ng DMW, Madam Chair.

asr-003033
02:53:34.620 --> 02:53:41.160
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: On the part of DMW, Madam Chair, I will pass the mic out to them.

asr-003034
02:53:41.720 --> 02:53:42.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-003035
02:53:44.020 --> 02:53:48.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron din bang pondo para halimbawa po mga gender sensitivity training

asr-003036
02:53:48.640 --> 02:53:54.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa mga gender sensitive, trauma-informed and victim-centered na approach

asr-003037
02:53:54.800 --> 02:53:58.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa pag-i-interview, processing ng iba't ibang tipo ng kaso?

asr-003038
02:53:59.080 --> 02:54:03.940
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Numero uno po yan, Madam Chair, dahil po yan ang mandato ng OWA.

asr-003039
02:54:04.020 --> 02:54:05.620
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Nakalagay po yan sa charter.

asr-003040
02:54:06.280 --> 02:54:10.780
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Nakatutok po kami sa paggawa ng gender responsive program.

asr-003041
02:54:10.840 --> 02:54:11.840
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Especially po.

asr-003042
02:54:11.980 --> 02:54:19.580
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Dito po sa mga distress situation, napaka-importante yung gender sensitivity, Madam Chair.

asr-003043
02:54:20.240 --> 02:54:32.620
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: And you have my commitment as the administrator na lagi po nating itataas ang antas ng serbisyo

asr-003044
02:54:32.620 --> 02:54:38.480
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: at nakatutok talaga doon sa pagiging, sa pagpakita ng empathy, Madam Chair.

asr-003045
02:54:38.480 --> 02:54:40.860
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Kasi minsan po talaga.

asr-003046
02:54:40.860 --> 02:54:46.840
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Pag-crisis na, talagang very highly emotional po ang ating mga kababayan.

asr-003047
02:54:46.960 --> 02:54:52.460
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: So, patuloy po ang, tuloy-tuloy po ang training, retraining.

asr-003048
02:54:52.720 --> 02:54:59.920
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: At saka, Madam Chair, on your point earlier, importante rin po sa amin yung care for the frontliners.

asr-003049
02:55:00.620 --> 02:55:08.980
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Kasi ho, pag sobrang puyatin po or kaya po 24-7 na nagsiservisyo, lalo na pag may crisis,

asr-003050
02:55:09.000 --> 02:55:10.480
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: importante rin po yan.

asr-003051
02:55:10.520 --> 02:55:17.480
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Kaya marami rin po kaming mga capacity building, mga programa para dito po sa ating mga personnel.

asr-003052
02:55:17.920 --> 02:55:24.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May pinakahuling bilang po ba kayo ng mga kaso ng abuso na lumapit po sa inyo?

asr-003053
02:55:24.740 --> 02:55:30.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ilan po dito may percentage po ba kayo nung may kinalaman rin sa gender-based violence?

asr-003054
02:55:31.220 --> 02:55:37.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa amin kasi, Madam Chair, nabanggit ko na rin naman po ito sa DMW tsaka sa OWA.

asr-003055
02:55:37.100 --> 02:55:40.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming po talaga nagpapatulong ng mga kababayan.

asr-003056
02:55:40.500 --> 02:55:43.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tayong OFWs pagdating sa ganitong mga kaso.

asr-003057
02:55:43.620 --> 02:55:48.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At marami po kasi sa kanila dahil nga mahirap na pong habulin yung mga perpetrators ng violence.

asr-003058
02:55:48.980 --> 02:55:59.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Talagang ang sinasalalayan na lang na tulong ay yung availability ng psychosocial support at yung mga reintegration programs na meron tayo.

asr-003059
02:56:01.560 --> 02:56:06.760
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Madam Chair, meron po tayong numero, Madam Chair.

asr-003060
02:56:07.100 --> 02:56:11.040
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Ito po ay nakakategorize sa klase ng welfare case.

asr-003061
02:56:11.440 --> 02:56:30.420
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Madam Chair, patungkol po sa sexual abuse or harassment, ma'am, from January to June 2026 po, ang reported po at na tulungan ng OWA ay nasa 1,800 po across the buong mundo na po ito.

asr-003062
02:56:30.440 --> 02:56:33.700
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: From Asia Pacific, Middle East, and Europe and Americas.

asr-003063
02:56:33.700 --> 02:56:39.380
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Kung ikukumpara po ito sa numero ng January to December 2025 po,

asr-003064
02:56:39.500 --> 02:56:52.580
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: masasabi po natin na nasa 2,600 po ang kaso po ng ganitong klase ng abuse at violence na hinarap po ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-003065
02:56:53.480 --> 02:57:02.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, mahingi po tayo ng kasalukuyan na ginagawa nilang referral system, pakikipagtulungan sa iba't ibang agencies tulad ng DSWD.

asr-003066
02:57:02.580 --> 02:57:09.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Paano po yung chain of custody kung merong urgent na kaso at marami pa pong ibang tulong na available?

asr-003067
02:57:09.180 --> 02:57:11.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-003068
02:57:11.180 --> 02:57:20.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, Madam Chair, gusto ko naman pong magtanong tungkol sa collection ng verification fee para sa mga contracts at labor-related documents.

asr-003069
02:57:20.520 --> 02:57:28.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Saan po ba napupunta yung mga kinukolekta nating verification fees? At magkano ang nakolekta?

asr-003070
02:57:28.300 --> 02:57:32.000
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yes, with your permission, I will ask Usec. Niki to respond.

asr-003071
02:57:32.000 --> 02:57:36.160
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But let me respond first to the matter on gender sensitivity training.

asr-003072
02:57:36.340 --> 02:57:38.780
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Rest assured, Madam Congresswoman, Madam Chair,

asr-003073
02:57:38.780 --> 02:57:48.020
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: wala po tayong personel na umaalis na hindi nakakadaan sa gender sensitivity, gender responsiveness training.

asr-003074
02:57:48.360 --> 02:57:49.800
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Napakahalaga po sa amin yan.

asr-003075
02:57:50.900 --> 02:58:01.920
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: As we always like to say, a substantial number, more than a vast majority of our workers assisted are female workers.

asr-003076
02:58:02.180 --> 02:58:08.400
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And not just female workers, but those who also belong in the LGBTQ plus sector.

asr-003077
02:58:09.250 --> 02:58:15.420
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kaya dito rin po ang napakahalaga ng gender responsiveness on our part.

asr-003078
02:58:15.520 --> 02:58:27.280
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And we do not tolerate any form of mishandling of any case along these lines, sa gender insensitivity ng ating personnel.

asr-003079
02:58:27.760 --> 02:58:34.360
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: At kaduktong din po dito yung aspeto ng medical retainership at yung binabanggit ni Admin PY na mental health issues.

asr-003080
02:58:34.600 --> 02:58:37.500
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kasi, when we are in the hands of expert

asr-003081
02:58:37.500 --> 02:58:39.960
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: medical care, such as a medical retainer,

asr-003082
02:58:40.000 --> 02:58:47.760
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: then we are assured na ang handling ng kaso, let's say physical or emotional abuse,

asr-003083
02:58:47.760 --> 02:58:56.700
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: ng isang female worker or LGBTQ plus worker is well handled or managed kapag medical expert ang nagahandle.

asr-003084
02:58:56.700 --> 02:59:04.740
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kaya mahalaga po yung binabanggit na medical retainership because we want the medical expertise of a person,

asr-003085
02:59:05.020 --> 02:59:08.100
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: of a health worker, to take care of these types of cases.

asr-003086
02:59:08.100 --> 02:59:12.900
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Now, dun po sa verification fee, yes, it is under the DMW.

asr-003087
02:59:13.960 --> 02:59:20.920
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: For every contract verified, there is a US$10 fee.

asr-003088
02:59:21.080 --> 02:59:24.120
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: This is under the auspices of the DMW.

asr-003089
02:59:24.780 --> 02:59:32.360
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: It is a collected fee that partially reverts back to our operations.

asr-003090
02:59:32.520 --> 02:59:34.060
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And I will ask Usec. Niki

asr-003091
02:59:34.060 --> 02:59:37.300
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: to discuss this matter.

asr-003092
02:59:38.020 --> 02:59:40.080
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, with the permission of the Chair,

asr-003093
02:59:40.260 --> 02:59:44.540
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Usec. Niki can take up the matter on the verification fees.

asr-003094
02:59:46.740 --> 02:59:50.200
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Thank you, Madam Chair, and with the permission of the Secretary po.

asr-003095
02:59:50.200 --> 03:00:12.520
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Ang current po natin ngayon for verification fee from fiscal year 2023 to 2026 present, meaning January to July po, it's around 5,851,298,096.

asr-003096
03:00:12.520 --> 03:00:23.720
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And these are deposited in the Bureau of Treasury po. And from that amount po, meron po tayong in-earmarked under our GAA.

asr-003097
03:00:24.200 --> 03:00:41.500
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So for 2024 po, we earmarked around 163 million. And then in 2025, that's 580 million. And for 2026, another 580 million.

asr-003098
03:00:41.500 --> 03:00:52.920
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: But under the 2027 NEP po, around 700 million po, 777 to be exact ang in-earmarked po under the 2027 NEP.

asr-003099
03:00:54.360 --> 03:01:03.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, meron pang more than 2 billion pesos na nasa Treasury na hindi pa po earmarked for particular purposes.

asr-003100
03:01:03.640 --> 03:01:09.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon Madam Chair, kasi meron din po tayong mga reports ng increases sa verification fees.

asr-003101
03:01:09.400 --> 03:01:11.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano po yung mga factors kung bakit kailangan

asr-003102
03:01:11.660 --> 03:01:14.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pong magtaas nitong mga verification fees?

asr-003103
03:01:16.800 --> 03:01:27.980
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: From what we've known, Your Honor, we have not increased the verification fee. It's pegged at 10 US dollars as mentioned by the Secretary.

asr-003104
03:01:28.720 --> 03:01:35.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Alright. Kung maaari niyo pong magbibigay po ako sa inyo ng ulat tungkol po sa mga nakuha namin na reports ng increase.

asr-003105
03:01:35.820 --> 03:01:40.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa po sa Hong Kong, sa Singapore, meron pong reports ng increases.

asr-003106
03:01:41.480 --> 03:01:44.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pwede pong ma-review na lang po ito ng DMW.

asr-003107
03:01:44.860 --> 03:01:55.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, atungkol naman Madam Chair sa cut sa budget ng Maritime Research and Skills Competency Program na nakapasok ang Maritime Training and Maritime Assessment Service,

asr-003108
03:01:56.060 --> 03:02:03.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: paano po maapekto ka ng budget cut na ito ang existing services natin para sa international seafarers?

asr-003109
03:02:04.620 --> 03:02:11.220
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: We have the Executive Director of the National Maritime Polytechnic here, but let me start it off as well.

asr-003110
03:02:12.520 --> 03:02:20.180
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: We have made significant strides sa 19th and 20th Congresses sa budget ng NMP. So we're very thankful.

asr-003111
03:02:21.060 --> 03:02:30.260
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Dahil dito, nagkaroon ng early phase 1 ng infrastructure improvements for the first time in 50 years.

asr-003112
03:02:30.260 --> 03:02:41.360
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Started during Marcos Sr.'s administration and finally resumed under Marcos Jr.'s administration na improve ang facilities sa National Maritime Polytechnic.

asr-003113
03:02:41.860 --> 03:02:49.140
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: For the first time, meron mga certain training programs that have been rendered free to our seafarers.

asr-003114
03:02:49.160 --> 03:02:57.460
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Hindi lang discounted or subsidized, completely free na certain programs and our Executive Director will provide the details on this.

asr-003115
03:02:57.460 --> 03:03:09.580
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So without further ado, Madam Chair, Madam Congresswoman, may request ED Victor Rosario to explain yung budget adjustments effect ng NEP sa NMP.

asr-003116
03:03:10.140 --> 03:03:11.040
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Thank you.

asr-003117
03:03:11.080 --> 03:03:32.220
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Madam Chair, Your Honors, with the permission of the Good Secretary, first of all, we would like to express our profound gratitude to Congress because it is only in this year that we received the highest budgetary allocation for the National Maritime Polytechnic since our inception in 1978.

asr-003118
03:03:32.780 --> 03:03:41.200
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: We have received 406 million for this year and 271 million of which will...

asr-003119
03:03:41.200 --> 03:03:52.180
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Fund the implementation of our modernization plan at NMP Tacloban, basically to improve our infrastructure for our training facilities.

asr-003120
03:03:52.780 --> 03:03:59.580
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: This October, we will be groundbreaking our 200 million dormitory with the President and the Secretary.

asr-003121
03:03:59.940 --> 03:04:09.300
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: We will also be constructing a new training pool of 32 million, another new firefighting area and many other infrastructure program.

asr-003122
03:04:09.300 --> 03:04:11.380
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: To implement our...

asr-003123
03:04:11.380 --> 03:04:12.620
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: modernization plan.

asr-003124
03:04:12.620 --> 03:04:23.960
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: And to answer the question of the Good Congresswoman Elago as to the decrease of the budget of NMP, primarily it's because of the reduced capital outlay.

asr-003125
03:04:24.020 --> 03:04:28.720
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Kasi napagbigyan na po tayo ng DBM ng 271 million for this year.

asr-003126
03:04:28.980 --> 03:04:38.220
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Now for next year, binigyan po tayo ng 53 million, 50 million of which will go to the construction of another training building.

asr-003127
03:04:38.220 --> 03:04:41.520
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Sapagkat kailangan po talaga natin, Congresswoman, yung...

asr-003128
03:04:41.520 --> 03:04:42.900
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Mga bagong...

asr-003129
03:04:42.900 --> 03:04:57.060
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Nang karagdagang training classroom sapagkat, as we speak, mayroon po tayong 40-year-old main training building sa NMP na ginawa pa ng mga Japanese, ng JICA.

asr-003130
03:04:57.260 --> 03:05:00.220
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: At currently, we have 26 rooms.

asr-003131
03:05:00.220 --> 03:05:09.400
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Nine rooms are used for simulator and our laboratory rooms where we store and house our simulator.

asr-003132
03:05:09.860 --> 03:05:11.200
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Sixteen lang po yung...

asr-003133
03:05:11.200 --> 03:05:12.760
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: nagagamit natin for instruction.

asr-003134
03:05:13.200 --> 03:05:21.020
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: And with the approval of the Good Secretary for our free training program, we expect more enrollment next year.

asr-003135
03:05:21.240 --> 03:05:25.780
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: That is why kailangan po talaga natin ng mga karagdagang classrooms.

asr-003136
03:05:25.780 --> 03:05:39.000
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Pero yung napagbigyan po sa DBM is only 50 million of the 125 million that we proposed that will enable us sana to construct additional 15 classrooms.

asr-003137
03:05:40.100 --> 03:05:41.560
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Kaya po nakikiusap...

asr-003138
03:05:41.560 --> 03:05:42.440
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: po tayo sa Kongreso.

asr-003139
03:05:42.500 --> 03:05:43.600
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Let me take this opportunity.

asr-003140
03:05:43.720 --> 03:05:53.960
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Isa lang po yung wish list ng NMP na sana ma-restore yung 76 million na kakulangan para makonstruct natin yung bagong training building.

asr-003141
03:05:53.960 --> 03:06:02.720
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Kasi nga po, dun sa free training program na in-approve po ni Secretary pursuant to DMW Memorandum Order 360,

asr-003142
03:06:03.440 --> 03:06:09.040
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: simula po nung August 3, lahat po ng regular training program ng NMP ay libre na po.

asr-003143
03:06:09.560 --> 03:06:10.380
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Libre na po.

asr-003144
03:06:10.480 --> 03:06:11.320
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Wala na pong bayad.

asr-003145
03:06:11.920 --> 03:06:13.020
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Talagang libre.

asr-003146
03:06:13.440 --> 03:06:15.180
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: We have 55 courses.

asr-003147
03:06:15.180 --> 03:06:23.340
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: And as a matter of fact, marami pong trainees na nanggagaling pa sa Zamboanga, pumupunta sa Tacloban.

asr-003148
03:06:23.960 --> 03:06:31.920
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: It's a long story bakit yung NMP ay nasa Tacloban, but to cut it short, it's because of the former First Lady Imelda Romaldes Marcos.

asr-003149
03:06:32.040 --> 03:06:34.380
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: That is why it's situated at the foot of San Juanico.

asr-003150
03:06:34.780 --> 03:06:35.700
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: And that is why...

asr-003151
03:06:38.760 --> 03:06:39.935
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Mr. Chair.

asr-003152
03:06:39.935 --> 03:06:40.863
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Sir, pwede ako?

asr-003153
03:06:42.567 --> 03:06:43.985
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Mr. Chair, let me...

asr-003154
03:06:44.540 --> 03:06:45.520
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-003155
03:06:45.520 --> 03:06:57.880
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: And as of August 3, we have already trained 3,026 seafarers that availed our free training program.

asr-003156
03:06:58.280 --> 03:07:04.360
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: And we are expecting, with the support of Secretary Cacdac, we've been given additional funding for our honoraria.

asr-003157
03:07:04.540 --> 03:07:10.960
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: We will be training maximum of 12,000 seafarers by the end of December.

asr-003158
03:07:11.040 --> 03:07:13.060
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: From August to...

asr-003159
03:07:13.060 --> 03:07:14.020
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: December.

asr-003160
03:07:16.360 --> 03:07:24.600
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Mr. Congressman, to answer your question, we are also exerting effort for our expansion plan.

asr-003161
03:07:25.000 --> 03:07:38.820
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: As a matter of fact, Congressman Revilla, your mother, attended our presentation of our feasibility study for the establishment of a regional training center in Tanza, Cavite.

asr-003162
03:07:39.700 --> 03:07:43.100
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: Yes, kasi may lupa po yung NMP doon sa Cavite.

asr-003163
03:07:43.630 --> 03:07:52.800
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: And another feasibility study, Mr. Congressman, Madam Chair, we will conduct it this year with the Development Academy of the Philippines.

asr-003164
03:07:52.800 --> 03:07:58.960
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: We will also be constructing, establishing an RTC in Davao City, and thereafter, CDO.

asr-003165
03:07:59.300 --> 03:08:04.820
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: We will also take into consideration Cagayan de Oro City, Madam Chair.

asr-003166
03:08:05.540 --> 03:08:07.060
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: That would be all, Madam Chair.

asr-003167
03:08:07.340 --> 03:08:10.620
NMP Executive Director III Victor A. Del Rosario: I hope I was able to satisfy the question of the good Congresswoman.

asr-003168
03:08:10.900 --> 03:08:12.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, maraming salamat.

asr-003169
03:08:12.100 --> 03:08:19.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nagalala rin po tayo, hindi lang doon sa mga pangangailangan sa bagong infrastruktura, para sa mas maraming training centers.

asr-003170
03:08:19.220 --> 03:08:23.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero yung pambayad po natin sa mga personnel, syempre marami po dyan.

asr-003171
03:08:23.680 --> 03:08:33.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi naman po dapat lang na honorarya, pero kung maaari, meron din tayong mga personnel na regular, may security of tenure,

asr-003172
03:08:33.800 --> 03:08:42.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at talagang mapagkakatiwalaan natin sa iba't ibang mga pangangailangan na may kinalaman sa maritime training and maritime assessment services.

asr-003173
03:08:42.500 --> 03:08:50.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Madam Chair, panghuli na lang po ng mga katanungan tungkol po sa mga services para sa ating seafarers.

asr-003174
03:08:50.820 --> 03:09:03.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bago ho ako magsimula sa mga katanungan na ito, meron na po bang update tungkol po doon sa ating search operations sa nawawala po na seafarer natin, si Sir George Miranda,

asr-003175
03:09:04.100 --> 03:09:10.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na napabalita kung nawawalaan itong March 2026 dahil po sa pag-atake sa kanilang tugboat sa Strait of Hormuz.

asr-003176
03:09:15.380 --> 03:09:19.840
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yes, unfortunately, wala pa po tayong kaukulang update.

asr-003177
03:09:22.100 --> 03:09:26.540
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: It's a function of kung saan po nangyari yung attack.

asr-003178
03:09:26.780 --> 03:09:37.560
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: It's in the Strait of Hormuz, kaya admittedly may kahirapan po sa pag-salvage nung tugboat kung saan siya naroon.

asr-003179
03:09:38.620 --> 03:09:45.820
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So we still are hoping na kahit pa pano, darating ang panahon na magkaroon din ng...

asr-003180
03:09:45.820 --> 03:09:52.060
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: salvaging ng tugboat kapag ligtas na ang sitwasyon sa Strait of Hormuz.

asr-003181
03:09:52.320 --> 03:09:56.260
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Ang sinasagawa po natin, I had personally met with Mrs. Miranda,

asr-003182
03:09:56.580 --> 03:10:05.240
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: at ang sinasagawa po natin ngayon is tinutulungan natin ng pamilya ng filing ng legal claims.

asr-003183
03:10:06.400 --> 03:10:13.000
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kasi po, meron na pong discussion with the ship owner in Dubai.

asr-003184
03:10:13.740 --> 03:10:16.180
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kaya meron na po tayong abogadong

asr-003185
03:10:16.180 --> 03:10:24.560
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: naatasan with the acceptance of Mrs. Miranda, kung saan yung lawyer po natin na nakikipag-usap ngayon sa ship owner doon.

asr-003186
03:10:24.560 --> 03:10:32.040
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kaya ongoing po ito, Madam Congresswoman, and rest assured, I personally have been in contact with Mrs. Miranda.

asr-003187
03:10:32.040 --> 03:10:37.620
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Naka-WhatsApp exchange ko lang po siya nung nakaraang araw.

asr-003188
03:10:37.620 --> 03:10:46.420
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: At hindi po natin ito bibitawan until magkaroon ng conclusion itong legal claims ng pamilya sa shipowner.

asr-003189
03:10:47.200 --> 03:10:57.540
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Pero aaminin ko po, sa ngayon po ay hindi po talaga na-recover yung human remains ni Oiler Miranda.

asr-003190
03:10:58.980 --> 03:11:09.740
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kaya patuloy pa rin tayong nag-umaasa na darating ang panahon na masasalvage kahit pa pano yung tugboat na kinalalagyan niya doon sa Strait of Hormuz.

asr-003191
03:11:19.660 --> 03:11:25.680
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yes, there is a document po here and I think we can provide...

asr-003192
03:11:25.680 --> 03:11:36.080
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: you a copy of a note verbal along these lines, but for the sanctity of the grief that Mrs. Miranda is going through,

asr-003193
03:11:36.240 --> 03:11:42.100
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: we will just furnish you a copy of this document from the Omani government, Madam Congresswoman.

asr-003194
03:11:43.220 --> 03:11:45.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Madam Chair.

asr-003195
03:11:45.800 --> 03:11:49.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At hindi po tayo nawawala ng pag-asa.

asr-003196
03:11:50.120 --> 03:11:54.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagdating po sa mga kaso ng nawawala na seafarer,

asr-003197
03:11:55.520 --> 03:11:59.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pati na rin po sa kaso ng iba pa nating OFWs in distress,

asr-003198
03:12:00.680 --> 03:12:09.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nagpapaabot din po tayo ng pakikiramay doon sa recent lang po na napabalita na meron din po si seafarer na isang deceased.

asr-003199
03:12:09.660 --> 03:12:18.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Habang meron po tayong mga na-rescue, meron din po isang namatay dahil nga sa kalagayan sa Strait of Hormuz.

asr-003200
03:12:18.780 --> 03:12:25.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po, sa tingin ko, Madam Chair, habang tayo po ay nanghihingi dito ng status update,

asr-003201
03:12:25.880 --> 03:12:33.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mga kinakailangan na information para mapalakas yung mga programa natin para sa OFW at seafarer's protection.

asr-003202
03:12:34.520 --> 03:12:39.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kinakailangan din po talaga yung pondo para sa reintegration program.

asr-003203
03:12:40.420 --> 03:12:50.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi sa huli't huli, yung kailangan naman natin talaga regular at disenteng trabaho dito sa Pilipinas para sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-003204
03:12:50.140 --> 03:12:51.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakabubuhay na sahod.

asr-003205
03:12:51.620 --> 03:12:55.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya malaki ang role ng reintegration program dyan.

asr-003206
03:12:56.700 --> 03:13:02.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil po naubusan ako ng oras, ah, hingin na lang po natin yung report mula sa DMW.

asr-003207
03:13:03.340 --> 03:13:12.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bukod dun sa mga proposed nila na mga programs na hindi po nakasama sa NEP para sa reintegration program at para sa action fund,

asr-003208
03:13:13.540 --> 03:13:18.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hingin din po natin yung mga kasulukuyan nilang pakikipagtulungan sa DOLE, sa DTI,

asr-003209
03:13:18.160 --> 03:13:25.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para ho matiyak na meron talagang trabaho dito sa Pilipinas, may tulong para sa pangkabuhayan yung ating mga kababayan.

asr-003210
03:13:26.200 --> 03:13:40.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At panghuli, yung mga kababayan naman po natin naghihintay pa po ng sagot ng pagdating sa request nila sa action fund mula pa po January-February nitong taong 2026.

asr-003211
03:13:41.060 --> 03:13:49.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sana po ay matugunan na ng ating DMW, ng OWWA at lahat ng mga kasama nating agencies ngayong hapon.

asr-003212
03:13:49.380 --> 03:13:50.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat Madam Chair.

asr-003213
03:13:50.960 --> 03:13:54.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sana po hindi tayo pumayag na

asr-003214
03:13:54.360 --> 03:13:55.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi po tumaas

asr-003215
03:13:55.920 --> 03:14:02.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang pondo ng DMW, ng OWWA, ng lahat po na nandirito mula sa 2027 proposed NEP.

asr-003216
03:14:02.800 --> 03:14:08.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sana po may magandang balita pagdating po sa 2027 General Appropriations Bill sa plenaryo.

asr-003217
03:14:08.720 --> 03:14:09.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat.

asr-003218
03:14:11.340 --> 03:14:14.480
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Madam Chair, if I may respond.

asr-003219
03:14:15.080 --> 03:14:20.400
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yes, magbigay na rin po ako ng kabuong ulat about the Strait of Hormuz.

asr-003220
03:14:21.420 --> 03:14:26.620
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: While around 3,000 seafarers have already exited out of the Strait of Hormuz,

asr-003221
03:14:26.620 --> 03:14:38.020
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: ay merong mga 28 ships that had been attacked the Strait with around 380 seafarers on board.

asr-003222
03:14:38.240 --> 03:14:42.860
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Karamihan po sa kanila ay naka-uwi na, 256 ay naka-uwi na.

asr-003223
03:14:45.160 --> 03:14:47.260
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Most of them are unharmed.

asr-003224
03:14:47.720 --> 03:14:50.060
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: 367 are unharmed out of the 379.

asr-003225
03:14:50.740 --> 03:14:56.600
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: however, 10 injured, one missing nga po, and we will provide the note verbal

asr-003226
03:14:56.620 --> 03:14:58.600
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: from the Omani government on the latest.

asr-003227
03:15:00.220 --> 03:15:08.600
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And yes, I can confirm na three days ago, we had our second incident na, and this time

asr-003228
03:15:08.600 --> 03:15:11.900
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: confirmed fatality po, sa Strait of Hormuz.

asr-003229
03:15:11.980 --> 03:15:18.580
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But rest assured, I personally had conveyed the condolences in behalf of the President

asr-003230
03:15:18.580 --> 03:15:19.920
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: to the family.

asr-003231
03:15:20.040 --> 03:15:25.160
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: I have met the family for myself and assured them of sympathies and support.

asr-003232
03:15:25.680 --> 03:15:34.100
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And meron pong bilang pong na awaiting repatriation pa rin po, around 53.

asr-003233
03:15:34.260 --> 03:15:41.480
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So 256 have been repatriated with 53 awaiting repatriation dito sa Strait of Hormuz.

asr-003234
03:15:42.580 --> 03:15:48.380
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And then doon naman po sa mga barko sa Persian Gulf, we continue.

asr-003235
03:15:48.380 --> 03:15:53.160
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: To provide, there are still around 3,000 seafarers remaining in the Persian Gulf.

asr-003236
03:15:53.160 --> 03:15:58.660
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: At meron naman po tayong patuloy na coordination with the ship owners to provide basic food

asr-003237
03:15:58.660 --> 03:16:05.160
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: and supplies doon sa mga ships na nag-carrying Filipino seafarers still within the Gulf,

asr-003238
03:16:05.340 --> 03:16:10.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Persian Gulf, para patuloy po ang pag-replenish ng kanilang food and water and basic supplies

asr-003239
03:16:10.880 --> 03:16:13.900
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: habang nandun sila sa Persian Gulf, awaiting exit.

asr-003240
03:16:15.440 --> 03:16:17.560
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Thank you so much, Sec. Hans.

asr-003242
03:16:17.780 --> 03:16:28.160
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: May we also request for us to be furnished with the data that you just presented, Sec., alongside Congresswoman Sarah Elago.

asr-003243
03:16:28.940 --> 03:16:29.520
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Thank you, Sec.

asr-003244
03:16:30.100 --> 03:16:32.860
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Maraming salamat din, Representative Sarah Elago.

asr-003245
03:16:34.460 --> 03:16:41.060
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Now, for the next interpellator, from the majority and from the City of Golden Friendship,

asr-003246
03:16:42.620 --> 03:16:46.780
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: The chair recognizes Honorable Rufus Rodriguez.

asr-003247
03:16:47.280 --> 03:16:48.160
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you.

asr-003248
03:16:49.800 --> 03:16:51.660
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you very much.

asr-003249
03:16:51.700 --> 03:16:58.900
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Madam Chair, my fellow Mindanaonon, and I thank you as you are now chairing this very important hearing.

asr-003250
03:16:59.220 --> 03:17:08.240
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And let me just thank my good friend, a career-outstanding, hardworking Secretary that we have.

asr-003251
03:17:08.240 --> 03:17:17.760
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Starting with Director-Bureau of Labor Relations, then 2010 Undersecretary for Labor Relations also,

asr-003252
03:17:17.880 --> 03:17:20.340
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: then POEA Administrator.

asr-003253
03:17:20.540 --> 03:17:22.080
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Then OWWA Administrator.

asr-003254
03:17:22.240 --> 03:17:23.580
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Then Undersecretary.

asr-003255
03:17:23.580 --> 03:17:24.700
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And then now, Secretary.

asr-003256
03:17:25.100 --> 03:17:27.840
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you so much for your service to the nation.

asr-003258
03:17:30.000 --> 03:17:35.920
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Your service to the nation has also very much extended to Cagayan de Oro.

asr-003259
