Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: I used to call you and immediately you will repatriate our workers in many areas of the world,

asr-003260
03:17:44.620 --> 03:17:49.080
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: and they come to Cagayan de Oro back to their families if they have problems.

asr-003261
03:17:49.340 --> 03:17:50.360
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you so much for that.

asr-003262
03:17:50.560 --> 03:17:52.540
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And recently, together with our

asr-003265
03:17:52.540 --> 03:17:55.240
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: OWWA Administrator, PY Caunan,

asr-003266
03:17:55.700 --> 03:18:03.400
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: We thank both of you because the war in Iran started on February 28th.

asr-003267
03:18:03.400 --> 03:18:04.240
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: You can remember that.

asr-003268
03:18:04.360 --> 03:18:08.220
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: President Trump immediately bombed Tehran.

asr-003269
03:18:08.820 --> 03:18:21.220
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And then at the time only a month after, the first week of April, you repatriated a hundred, about 90 plus from Region 10.

asr-003271
03:18:21.380 --> 03:18:22.820
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Out of that, 20

asr-003272
03:18:22.820 --> 03:18:24.640
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Cagayanons

asr-003273
03:18:24.640 --> 03:18:26.480
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: from Cagayan de Oro, repatriated.

asr-003274
03:18:26.520 --> 03:18:28.780
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you. And then, PY Caunan

asr-003275
03:18:28.780 --> 03:18:30.620
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: took care of reintegration

asr-003276
03:18:30.620 --> 03:18:32.580
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: of this, of our

asr-003277
