Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Cagayan de Oro workers.

asr-003278
03:18:35.580 --> 03:18:36.900
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And, we have to

asr-003279
03:18:36.900 --> 03:18:38.240
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: congratulate. We have here

asr-003280
03:18:38.240 --> 03:18:40.520
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Director, First Director, Manny Toledo.

asr-003281
03:18:41.680 --> 03:18:42.500
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Please rise.

asr-003282
03:18:43.440 --> 03:18:44.580
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Camera, camera,

asr-003283
03:18:44.580 --> 03:18:45.240
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: can you focus?

asr-003284
03:18:47.740 --> 03:18:50.300
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Kasi ano pa yan eh? He was still with DOLE.

asr-003285
03:18:50.460 --> 03:18:51.500
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Outstanding na yan.

asr-003286
