asr-003289
03:18:58.340 --> 03:19:00.540
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Giving the DOLE,

asr-003290
03:19:00.780 --> 03:19:02.400
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: you know, the TUPAD and everything,

asr-003291
03:19:02.700 --> 03:19:04.920
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: GIP, and that's because of Manny Toledo.

asr-003292
03:19:05.140 --> 03:19:06.360
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And for, of course,

asr-003293
03:19:07.180 --> 03:19:08.460
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: for the OWWA,

asr-003294
03:19:09.500 --> 03:19:10.640
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: is Eugene

asr-003295
03:19:10.640 --> 03:19:11.760
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Mesias here?

asr-003296
03:19:12.120 --> 03:19:13.940
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Wala nga eh. I know.

asr-003297
03:19:15.200 --> 03:19:16.960
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: You did not have the

asr-003298
03:19:16.960 --> 03:19:18.760
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: director, but let me tell you, he

asr-003299
03:19:18.760 --> 03:19:20.400
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: helped our repatriated

asr-003300
03:19:20.400 --> 03:19:21.740
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Cagayanons. So,

