OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Doon po tulong-tulong ang iba't-ibang ahensya ng gobyerno.

asr-003671
03:34:05.200 --> 03:34:06.640
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Nagbibigay po tayo ng training.

asr-003672
03:34:06.640 --> 03:34:09.380
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Kahit na ho assessment, doon na rin ho ginagawa.

asr-003673
03:34:09.380 --> 03:34:11.760
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Para po sa ating mga kababayan,

asr-003674
03:34:11.760 --> 03:34:14.000
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: para pagbalik nila, upskilled na sila.

asr-003675
03:34:14.000 --> 03:34:18.340
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Hindi nasisimulan pa lang sa ating, dito sa ating bansa.

asr-003676
03:34:18.340 --> 03:34:20.180
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: At hindi lamang po yun.

asr-003677
03:34:20.180 --> 03:34:23.300
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Meron din po tayo doong mga medical mission,

asr-003678
03:34:23.300 --> 03:34:25.480
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: care of mga volunteer, doctors,

asr-003679
03:34:25.480 --> 03:34:27.200
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: po, na sa Hong Kong.

asr-003680
03:34:27.200 --> 03:34:30.120
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Meron din po tayong, of course, legal assistance.

asr-003681
03:34:30.120 --> 03:34:34.880
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: At yung iba't-iba po nating mga community events para sa Philcom.

asr-003682
03:34:34.960 --> 03:34:37.540
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Dito na po sa center natin, sa Hong Kong,

asr-003683
03:34:37.540 --> 03:34:41.400
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: ginagawa similar to Taipei at saka sa Kuala Lumpur,

asr-003684
03:34:41.400 --> 03:34:43.760
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: na sana ho, mabisita po ninyo.

asr-003685
03:34:45.920 --> 03:34:49.760
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Pangatlo po ay ang Workers' Auxiliary Support Project.

asr-003686
03:34:50.440 --> 03:34:55.460
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Madam Chair, dito po papasok ang medical retainers na gustong idagdag ng OWWA.

asr-003687
03:34:55.460 --> 03:34:59.280
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Para po sa mga kababayan natin na yung iba ho,

asr-003688
03:34:59.340 --> 03:35:00.840
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: hindi na covered ng insurance,

asr-003689
03:35:01.080 --> 03:35:04.120
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: ay kailangan po ng medical assistance, no.

asr-003690
03:35:04.800 --> 03:35:07.500
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Katuwang ang Department of Migrant Workers.

asr-003691
03:35:07.740 --> 03:35:10.860
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: So, maasahan niyo, aside from legal assistance,

asr-003692
03:35:11.240 --> 03:35:15.080
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: makapag-provide na rin po tayo ng medical retainers, no.

asr-003693
03:35:16.120 --> 03:35:21.340
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Pangatlo po, katulad po ng DMW, Capital Outlay po.

asr-003694
03:35:21.860 --> 03:35:24.640
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Lumang-luma na ho ang building ng OWWA.

asr-003695
03:35:24.860 --> 03:35:31.160
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Madam Chair, meron na po kami mga built-in waterfalls dahil sa bagyo.

asr-003696
03:35:31.160 --> 03:35:35.900
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Actually po, to be serious about it,

asr-003697
03:35:36.000 --> 03:35:43.660
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: we had two assessments made by the Department of Public Works and Highways, DPWH.

asr-003698
03:35:43.660 --> 03:35:46.300
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: The assessment po came back.

asr-003699
03:35:46.300 --> 03:35:50.100
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: And we will present to the committee.

asr-003700
03:35:50.100 --> 03:35:54.060
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: So, apparently, we are only at

asr-003701
03:35:54.060 --> 03:36:02.580
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: 10% of the minimum standard for the structural integrity to face seismic risk.

asr-003702
03:36:03.670 --> 03:36:07.800
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: So, it's more of the safety na po ng ating mga frontliners,

asr-003703
03:36:07.840 --> 03:36:10.660
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: especially po yung ating mga OFW clients.

asr-003704
03:36:10.860 --> 03:36:14.920
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: So, we are seeking as well support, Madam Chair.

asr-003705
03:36:14.980 --> 03:36:17.100
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Is this for the construction, 50, or renovation?

asr-003706
03:36:17.100 --> 03:36:20.220
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: This is for renovation.

asr-003707
03:36:20.220 --> 03:36:24.500
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: And of course, construction also of

asr-003708
03:36:24.500 --> 03:36:31.400
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Regional offices, particularly Region 5 po, nabigyan po tayo ng lupa para dito.

asr-003709
03:36:31.580 --> 03:36:38.540
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: And then, of course, the extension for the training center and yung iba pa po nating facilities for Region 2.

asr-003710
03:36:42.220 --> 03:36:44.980
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: The Seafarer Welfare Center, sir.

asr-003711
03:36:44.980 --> 03:36:48.260
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: And the new office, sabi po ni Eugene.

asr-003712
03:36:50.490 --> 03:36:55.080
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Number 4 po, Madam Chair, dear Congressman,

asr-003713
03:36:55.640 --> 03:36:58.720
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: I invite you to reminisce a little bit.

asr-003714
03:36:58.900 --> 03:37:07.760
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: RA 8042-1995, the Congress created a program called the Congressional Migrant Worker Scholarship Program.

asr-003715
03:37:09.580 --> 03:37:20.460
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: But at that time, it was funded by PCSO, 150 million and 50 million from the CDF back then.

asr-003716
03:37:20.660 --> 03:37:25.840
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: But from that time until now, wala na pong naging restoration of this budget.

asr-003717
03:37:27.000 --> 03:37:32.180
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: This is supporting po, not just dependents, but also OFWs themselves.

asr-003718
03:37:32.720 --> 03:37:36.280
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Up to 60,000 po a year ang binibigay for 4 years.

asr-003719
03:37:36.580 --> 03:37:37.940
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Malaki pong tulong ito.

asr-003720
03:37:37.940 --> 03:37:47.300
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Ito po ay compared to the regular scholarship program of OWWA, which is sourced from the trust fund, the private trust fund of OWWA.

asr-003721
03:37:47.300 --> 03:37:48.760
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Ito po ay GAA-sourced.

asr-003722
03:37:49.260 --> 03:37:55.080
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Dito po ay pwede nating i-open up at maging mas accessible.

asr-003723
03:37:55.600 --> 03:38:03.380
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Ang scholarship para po sa ating pong mga kababayan, marami po talaga ang humihingi ng tulong, Madam Chair,

asr-003724
03:38:03.620 --> 03:38:08.640
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: sa pagpapaaral ng kanilang mga anak at syempre sa sarili po rin nila.

asr-003725
03:38:08.640 --> 03:38:13.060
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: With that po, our total is at 2 billion pesos.

asr-003726
03:38:13.220 --> 03:38:16.520
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Again, MOOE gas at 322 million.

asr-003727
03:38:16.840 --> 03:38:20.620
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: MOOE operations at 1.18 billion.

asr-003728
03:38:21.040 --> 03:38:25.320
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Capital outlay at 447.99 million.

asr-003729
03:38:25.440 --> 03:38:30.540
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: And the Congressional Migrant Workers Scholarship Program at an additional 50 million.

asr-003730
03:38:30.720 --> 03:38:32.120
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Thank you very much, Madam Chair, dear Congressman.

asr-003731
03:38:32.120 --> 03:38:33.980
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, PY Caunan.

asr-003732
03:38:34.040 --> 03:38:44.180
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Before I would move for the approval of the increase of 2 billion each, I would like to just state I have here a constituent.

asr-003733
03:38:44.360 --> 03:38:52.620
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: The problem in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, there is the non-issuance of resident permit, ICAMA.

asr-003734
03:38:52.920 --> 03:38:54.600
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Could you explain this one first?

asr-003735
03:38:54.600 --> 03:39:01.960
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: What is this ICAMA not issued by the government of the Kingdom?

asr-003736
03:39:01.960 --> 03:39:09.600
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Who should be able to have our residents there work and transact business?

asr-003737
03:39:10.220 --> 03:39:15.240
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yes, in general po, this is required for every OFW who goes there.

asr-003738
03:39:15.340 --> 03:39:18.820
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So every OFW has what you call an ICAMA, residence permit.

asr-003739
03:39:19.600 --> 03:39:24.100
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: However, it can happen na nagkakaroon ng legal problems.

asr-003740
03:39:24.600 --> 03:39:38.840
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Ang mga kababayan natin, most likely related sa kanilang stay, maaring nag-overstay, o di kaya perceived violations of their stay.

asr-003741
03:39:39.770 --> 03:39:45.720
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, ang key po dito, in brief, Mr. Chair, is the legal assistance through the AKSYON Fund.

asr-003742
03:39:45.980 --> 03:39:53.940
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, the good news is kami ni Usec. Jun Rasul just came from Jeddah and we met our lawyers in Saudi.

asr-003743
03:39:54.600 --> 03:40:05.560
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: The Tebiah Law Office who provides legal assistance, they have an array of 30 lawyers in their law firm who provide assistance to our workers.

asr-003744
03:40:05.860 --> 03:40:17.600
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, we easily refer these cases na hindi maka-renew ng ICAMA for immigration-related problems or labor-related problems one way or another.

asr-003745
03:40:17.900 --> 03:40:20.680
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, rest assured that we address this situation.

asr-003746
03:40:20.680 --> 03:40:23.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Some cases take longer than others, admittedly.

asr-003747
03:40:23.880 --> 03:40:37.800
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But rest assured, Mr. Congressman, Madam Chair, we are on top of the legal cases that are being handled by our law firm, our legal retainers, our in-house lawyers.

asr-003748
03:40:38.160 --> 03:40:49.540
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And also, kung merong utang po, halimbawa, sa ospital or immigration-related penalties, we shoulder these expenses for our workers.

asr-003749
03:40:50.680 --> 03:40:53.400
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-003750
03:40:54.300 --> 03:41:04.500
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: I now move for the approval of the budget of the DMW and the OWWA, plus 2 billion each.

asr-003751
03:41:05.820 --> 03:41:12.360
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Because we have to convince the Speaker and our Chairperson that this is a department which should all help.

asr-003752
03:41:12.520 --> 03:41:16.020
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: After all, we call our workers, overseas workers, our heroes.

asr-003753
03:41:16.360 --> 03:41:19.160
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And so, we should be able to work on that.

asr-003754
03:41:19.160 --> 03:41:21.460
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So, with our Chair, we will be able to do that.

asr-003755
03:41:21.460 --> 03:41:23.060
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So, move, Madam Chair.

asr-003756
03:41:23.060 --> 03:41:30.600
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Thank you so much, Honorable Rufus Rodriguez.

asr-003757
03:41:30.600 --> 03:41:38.540
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Though we very much appreciate the motion, we want to remind everyone that this is, our proceeding today is just a budget briefing.

asr-003758
03:41:38.540 --> 03:41:47.180
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: And, of course, the ruling would be considered in the proper time.

asr-003759
03:41:47.300 --> 03:41:47.680
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Proper time.

asr-003760
03:41:47.840 --> 03:41:48.180
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Yes.

asr-003761
03:41:48.300 --> 03:41:49.360
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you.

asr-003762
03:41:49.480 --> 03:41:50.120
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Thank you.

asr-003763
03:41:50.920 --> 03:41:53.320
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Thank you so much, Honorable Rufus Rodriguez.

asr-003764
03:41:53.340 --> 03:41:56.860
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Not just for your questions, but also for giving.

asr-003766
03:41:56.860 --> 03:41:57.900
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: life to this proceeding.

asr-003768
03:42:00.180 --> 03:42:03.680
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Even Secretary Hans was excited to answer your questions.

asr-003769
03:42:06.760 --> 03:42:09.840
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: I guess now we move on to our next interpolator.

asr-003770
03:42:09.880 --> 03:42:16.560
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Sorry, before we proceed with the next interpolator, I would like to recognize our House members present here today.

asr-003771
03:42:16.820 --> 03:42:24.440
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: We have Vice Chair Bella Vanessa Suansing and Representative Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan.

asr-003772
03:42:25.180 --> 03:42:26.360
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Magandang hapon po.

asr-003773
03:42:28.940 --> 03:42:29.540
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: All right.

asr-003774
03:42:29.540 --> 03:42:34.820
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Next to interpellate from the majority, we have Representative Florabel Yatco.

asr-003775
03:42:36.680 --> 03:42:39.900
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Good afternoon, Secretary, Admin PY.

asr-003776
03:42:40.980 --> 03:42:46.080
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Itatanong ko lang naman yung tulad nung nabanggit kanina ni Congressman Tina.

asr-003777
03:42:46.240 --> 03:42:47.380
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: It's about the OFW.

asr-003778
03:42:47.800 --> 03:42:57.320
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Like during 25-26, ilang pamilya at OFW ang nasilbihan natin dito sa hospital na ito?

asr-003779
03:42:57.320 --> 03:42:58.480
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: At for...

asr-003780
03:42:58.480 --> 03:43:11.440
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: 2027 na budget natin, ano po ang mga kongkretong improvements na maaaring nilang asahan sa pagdating sa mga access services at sa quality care ng OFW?

asr-003781
03:43:14.960 --> 03:43:21.540
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: I will request Usec. Niki Tutay who handles the hospital to answer the details.

asr-003782
03:43:21.540 --> 03:43:28.760
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But at the outset, 184,870 po ang napagsilbihan.

asr-003783
03:43:28.900 --> 03:43:30.040
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But this is beginning...

asr-003784
03:43:30.040 --> 03:43:37.000
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yung term ng ating mahal na Pangulo, ang panahon po natin sa Department of Migrant Workers.

asr-003785
03:43:37.900 --> 03:43:42.820
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: We can provide the necessary breakdowns on a year-to-year basis.

asr-003786
03:43:42.820 --> 03:43:52.120
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And yung kaukulang budget po na binigay sa atin is 423.59 million.

asr-003787
03:43:52.420 --> 03:43:58.460
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: However, as mentioned during the question of Congressman Rodriguez,

asr-003788
03:43:58.940 --> 03:44:00.800
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: we are seeking an additional...

asr-003789
03:44:00.800 --> 03:44:01.960
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: 200.

asr-003790
03:44:01.960 --> 03:44:03.680
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: million.

asr-003791
03:44:04.140 --> 03:44:08.860
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Can I request Usec. Niki, Madam Chair, to provide some more details?

asr-003792
03:44:12.860 --> 03:44:18.940
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: 'Yun pong nabanggit po ng ating kalihim ay 'yung number of patients, unique patients po ito.

asr-003793
03:44:18.940 --> 03:44:26.040
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So it could be the OFW herself, either a family also, or pwede rin po yung parents po ng OFWs.

asr-003794
03:44:26.160 --> 03:44:32.460
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So over the years po, tumataas naman po yung ating unique patient, sir.

asr-003795
03:44:32.640 --> 03:44:40.100
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So we started with around 7,383 back in second half of 2022.

asr-003796
03:44:40.100 --> 03:44:46.420
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then it rose to 34,634 patients.

asr-003797
03:44:46.980 --> 03:44:47.960
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then for...

asr-003798
03:44:47.960 --> 03:44:51.740
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: 2024, it's 44,516.

asr-003799
03:44:52.020 --> 03:44:57.380
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And in 2025, 59,000 or close to 60,000 po.

asr-003800
03:44:57.620 --> 03:45:14.040
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: For 2026 po, January until July, it's close to 40,000 na po na patients. And the services po, the diagnostics and the other medical services ay pataas po.

asr-003801
03:45:14.280 --> 03:45:30.180
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Sa ngayon po, this year, we were able to introduce the pre-employment medical exam at a lower rate compared to the other clinics or hospitals for our overseas Filipino workers before they depart.

asr-003802
03:45:30.180 --> 03:45:39.620
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: The other services po that we have ay yung pong cancer care, we are preparing it na.

asr-003803
03:45:40.040 --> 03:45:44.720
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: It's currently being constructed and we do hope po that by the first...

asr-003804
03:45:44.720 --> 03:45:46.500
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: To be launched on 2027, right?

asr-003805
03:45:46.520 --> 03:45:47.640
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: 2027 po.

asr-003806
03:45:47.780 --> 03:45:56.800
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then we want, we're targeting a level 3 because the bed capacity is around 102.

asr-003807
03:45:56.800 --> 03:46:03.980
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Sa ngayon po, we are at a level 2 with around 78 beds approved by the Department of Health.

asr-003808
03:46:05.260 --> 03:46:11.700
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: But for the number of patients, do you think, is it all coming from the central Luzon?

asr-003809
03:46:12.060 --> 03:46:12.460
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: No.

asr-003811
03:46:13.285 --> 03:46:23.360
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Based on our statistics, Your Honor, we have around 90 to 95% coming from Luzon, particularly po from central Luzon.

asr-003812
03:46:23.360 --> 03:46:31.700
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: But we have patients coming from Mindanao, Visayas, and also as far as Bicol region po.

asr-003813
03:46:32.440 --> 03:46:39.500
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Actually, sana nga magkaroon tayo, Mr. Chair, ng Luzon, Visayas, Mindanao na OFW Hospital.

asr-003814
03:46:39.980 --> 03:46:42.040
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: But for my second question,

asr-003815
03:46:42.440 --> 03:46:46.900
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: since nabanggit niyo na nga po yung cancer care center,

asr-003816
03:46:48.160 --> 03:46:54.500
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: can the department tell us how much is the 2027 budget specifically intended for the cancer care?

asr-003817
03:46:54.500 --> 03:46:58.360
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Aside from the 200 million, kasama na ba yung 200 million doon?

asr-003818
03:46:58.860 --> 03:47:05.740
Rep. Florabel C. Yatco: Enough ba siya to serve all the cancer patients, to pay the salaries of the special doctors?

asr-003819
03:47:05.740 --> 03:47:09.520
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: It may not be enough, Your Honor, but for

asr-003820
03:47:09.520 --> 03:47:20.960
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: 2027 NEP, our budget is around 400 million po.

asr-003821
03:47:21.080 --> 03:47:25.620
