asr-004172
04:05:44.200 --> 04:06:05.520
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Opo. So, ang pangalawa kong katanungan po, just recently lang po, yung siguro nabalita naman natin ito, yung sa Bicol. Recently lang po, yung DMW nag-shutdown ng alleged illegal recruitment operation sa Bicol,

asr-004173
04:06:05.520 --> 04:06:19.800
