asr-004178
04:07:04.080 --> 04:07:14.480
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: How will this scheme and how will DMW ensure that these services are readily accessible even to the victim in the island province like Katanduanis?

asr-004179
04:07:14.560 --> 04:07:15.240
