asr-004184
04:07:43.400 --> 04:07:50.460
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Kaya nagkaroon ng capability tayong mag-track down ng illegal recruitment activities all over the country.

asr-004185
04:07:50.460 --> 04:08:03.800
