asr-004339
04:14:06.780 --> 04:14:08.020
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-004340
04:14:08.160 --> 04:14:09.300
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: And good afternoon po,

asr-004341
04:14:09.320 --> 04:14:10.780
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Secretary, Administrator,

asr-004342
04:14:11.620 --> 04:14:12.700
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: and everyone who attended.

asr-004343
04:14:13.040 --> 04:14:15.880
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So, as a labor law practitioner

asr-004344
04:14:15.880 --> 04:14:17.580
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: before entering Congress,

asr-004345
04:14:17.880 --> 04:14:20.080
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: I have conducted a survey

asr-004346
04:14:20.080 --> 04:14:21.580
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: of the Philippine cases

asr-004347
04:14:21.580 --> 04:14:23.360
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: na have been decided

asr-004348
04:14:23.360 --> 04:14:25.120
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: regarding labor law.

asr-004349
04:14:25.300 --> 04:14:27.140
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: And nakakabahala lang po

asr-004350
04:14:27.140 --> 04:14:29.520
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: na isa sa mga usual na tinatalakay

asr-004351
04:14:29.520 --> 04:14:31.380
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: pagdating sa mga kaso

asr-004352
04:14:31.380 --> 04:14:32.500
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: na umaabot sa Supreme Court,

asr-004353
04:14:32.600 --> 04:14:35.660
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: palagi po tungkol sa medical repatriation

asr-004354
04:14:36.120 --> 04:14:37.440
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Dahil pag nakita po

asr-004355
04:14:37.440 --> 04:14:38.300
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: natin yung mga

asr-004356
04:14:38.300 --> 04:14:40.000
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: rules tungkol dito,

asr-004357
04:14:40.980 --> 04:14:42.420
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: napaka-stringent

asr-004358
04:14:42.420 --> 04:14:43.880
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: or confusing minsan

asr-004359
04:14:43.880 --> 04:14:44.920
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: para sa ating mga

asr-004360
04:14:44.920 --> 04:14:46.540
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: repatriated na mga...

asr-004361
04:14:46.540 --> 04:14:51.640
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: OFWs, kung paano ba susundin yung mga third-party doctors,

asr-004362
04:14:52.480 --> 04:15:00.100
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: paano po ba yung mga susundin nila na timeline when it comes to securing the opinion of a third-party doctor.

asr-004363
04:15:00.520 --> 04:15:07.040
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So makikita po natin na maraming beses po na hindi po nakakaklaim ang ating OFWs

asr-004364
04:15:07.040 --> 04:15:11.500
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: ng mga medical reimbursements na dapat nakukuha po nila sa mga kumpanya.

asr-004365
04:15:11.500 --> 04:15:18.720
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So yung tanong ko lang po, Secretary, ano po ba yung mga measures natin para masiguro na natutulungan po natin

asr-004366
04:15:18.720 --> 04:15:21.300
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: yung mga ganitong medically repatriated OFWs?

asr-004367
04:15:21.400 --> 04:15:28.340
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: And meron po ba tayong figures kung gano'ng karami po yung mga applicants for assistance

asr-004368
04:15:28.340 --> 04:15:31.240
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: kung meron pong binibigay po ang DMW sa kanila?

asr-004369
04:15:32.460 --> 04:15:33.220
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Salamat po.

asr-004370
04:15:34.200 --> 04:15:37.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Thank you, Mr. Congressman and Madam Chair.

asr-004371
04:15:39.740 --> 04:15:41.360
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Definitely, you are known.

asr-004372
04:15:41.360 --> 04:15:50.560
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: As a legal labor practitioner. And we very well could work with your good office, Mr. Congressman,

asr-004373
04:15:50.800 --> 04:15:58.100
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: along the lines of helping our OFWs overcome yung legal challenges nila, lalo na yung mga tripulante natin.

asr-004374
04:15:58.200 --> 04:16:05.640
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Indeed, the Magna Carta for Seafarers has resolved in terms of policy, practice,

asr-004375
04:16:05.840 --> 04:16:10.080
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: itong problema sa recovery of compensation claims.

asr-004376
04:16:10.080 --> 04:16:20.340
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So we have undertaken the IRR, the rules and regulations to implement the institutionalization of third-party doctors

asr-004377
04:16:20.340 --> 04:16:26.400
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: as well as working closely with the DOH along these lines.

asr-004378
04:16:27.060 --> 04:16:31.940
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: With your permission, Mr. Congressman, Madam Chair, may I ask Usec. Bernard Olalia,

asr-004379
04:16:32.120 --> 04:16:40.860
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: to also provide us further details as he has been on top of the IRR development implementation as well of the Magna Carta.

asr-004380
04:16:43.040 --> 04:16:48.120
DMW Undersecretary Bernard P. Olalia: With the kind permission of the Secretary, one of the greatest accomplishments of this administration,

asr-004381
04:16:48.360 --> 04:16:52.580
DMW Undersecretary Bernard P. Olalia: including this Congress, is yung the passage of the Magna Carta for Seafarers.

asr-004382
04:16:52.580 --> 04:16:55.500
DMW Undersecretary Bernard P. Olalia: At tama po si Sec, meron na pong IRR niyan.

asr-004383
04:16:55.620 --> 04:17:02.340
DMW Undersecretary Bernard P. Olalia: And under the rules ng Magna Carta, first would be the assessment, medical assessment to be conducted by the company doctor.

asr-004384
04:17:02.840 --> 04:17:09.000
DMW Undersecretary Bernard P. Olalia: If the company doctor's assessment is not objected to by the OFW, that will be a final assessment.

asr-004385
04:17:09.360 --> 04:17:12.760
DMW Undersecretary Bernard P. Olalia: However, kung meron ang counter-assessment si OFW,

asr-004386
04:17:12.820 --> 04:17:17.620
DMW Undersecretary Bernard P. Olalia: medical doctor at conflict doon sa company doctor, we need a third doctor.

asr-004387
04:17:17.920 --> 04:17:20.400
DMW Undersecretary Bernard P. Olalia: doon po papasok yung DMW intervention.

asr-004388
04:17:20.400 --> 04:17:31.420
DMW Undersecretary Bernard P. Olalia: Because the DMW will craft the guidelines for the selection of a third doctor to be chosen from among the doctors ng DOH.

asr-004389
04:17:31.660 --> 04:17:39.180
DMW Undersecretary Bernard P. Olalia: And currently, meron po kaming kinacraft na joint guidelines with the DOH for the selection of the third doctor.

asr-004390
04:17:39.520 --> 04:17:42.840
DMW Undersecretary Bernard P. Olalia: Ang isa pong kagandahan ng Magna Carta is the

asr-004391
04:17:42.840 --> 04:17:49.800
DMW Undersecretary Bernard P. Olalia: action fund to be utilized as a surety bond in case na magkaroon po ng appeal,

asr-004392
04:17:50.400 --> 04:17:54.100
DMW Undersecretary Bernard P. Olalia: yung decision to be issued by the NLRC or NCMB.

asr-004393
04:17:54.340 --> 04:18:01.240
DMW Undersecretary Bernard P. Olalia: So along these lines, the DMW will be ready to assist in the full implementation of the provisions of the Magna Carta po.

asr-004394
04:18:02.800 --> 04:18:04.860
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Maraming salamat po, Usec. and Secretary.

asr-004395
04:18:05.760 --> 04:18:07.280
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: One last question lang po.

asr-004396
04:18:07.460 --> 04:18:09.280
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So, bali doon po sa action fund,

asr-004397
04:18:10.620 --> 04:18:13.160
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: would that be sufficient po sa dami po ng

asr-004398
04:18:13.160 --> 04:18:19.900
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: mga possible cases po na lumalapit po sa DMW at saka sa mga ganito po yung mga conflicting na mga opinions of the doctors,

asr-004399
04:18:20.400 --> 04:18:27.560
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Would the AKSYON Fund be enough po to assist these repatriated OFWs?

asr-004400
04:18:30.100 --> 04:18:33.340
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yes, it would be sufficient.

asr-004401
04:18:33.560 --> 04:18:34.840
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But of course, having said that,

asr-004402
04:18:34.980 --> 04:18:40.320
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: we are yet to determine the, to benchmark the experience.

asr-004403
04:18:40.320 --> 04:18:43.120
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But as we estimate it,

asr-004404
04:18:43.260 --> 04:18:51.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: ang makukover po dito would be sufficient in terms of the number of those who need to be legally assisted.

asr-004405
04:18:52.180 --> 04:18:57.540
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Because ang isang confidence level po namin ay yung increasing number of conciliated cases.

asr-004406
04:18:57.960 --> 04:19:01.100
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Whereas, you know, Mr. Congressman,

asr-004407
04:19:01.500 --> 04:19:06.340
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: hindi kailangan ng lawyers or adjudicatory services of a lawyer.

asr-004408
04:19:06.340 --> 04:19:13.000
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, in which case, with conciliation as a main mode of dispute settlement,

asr-004409
04:19:13.320 --> 04:19:17.920
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: hindi na nga ho kailangan umabot sa legal intervention,

asr-004410
04:19:18.220 --> 04:19:21.320
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: let's say sa NLRC or elsewhere, voluntary arbitration.

asr-004411
04:19:21.320 --> 04:19:27.820
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, we're confident that may increasing, as confirmed by the sector, the industry,

asr-004412
04:19:28.000 --> 04:19:33.640
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: may increasing number of conciliated cases and settled through conciliation.

asr-004413
04:19:33.640 --> 04:19:37.740
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, we're confident na this won't necessitate the hiring of a lawyer.

asr-004414
04:19:38.260 --> 04:19:39.720
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Sir, if I may add as well

asr-004415
04:19:39.900 --> 04:19:43.580
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: as regards the efforts of OWWA

asr-004416
04:19:43.580 --> 04:19:48.400
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: when it comes to conciliation, specifically of sea-based workers,

asr-004417
04:19:49.420 --> 04:19:52.480
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: we have reached last year for 2025,

asr-004418
04:19:52.480 --> 04:19:56.360
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: 99.23% settlement rate.

asr-004419
04:19:56.480 --> 04:20:01.240
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: The monetary claims awarded is close to 180 million.

asr-004420
04:20:01.600 --> 04:20:04.940
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: If you add that to a land base,

asr-004421
04:20:05.240 --> 04:20:08.200
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: our total settlement rate is at 94%.

asr-004422
04:20:08.200 --> 04:20:10.320
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: So, it's quite a good number.

asr-004423
04:20:10.320 --> 04:20:11.220
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: And

asr-004424
04:20:11.220 --> 04:20:14.140
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: close to 200,

asr-004425
04:20:14.440 --> 04:20:18.020
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: over 202 million in settlement amount.

asr-004426
04:20:18.180 --> 04:20:18.900
OWWA Administrator Patricia Yvonne "PY" M. Caunan: Thank you so much.

asr-004427
04:20:29.220 --> 04:20:30.740
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Bale, yun lang po Madam Chair,

asr-004428
04:20:30.900 --> 04:20:33.020
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Secretary, Administrator, and USEC.

asr-004429
04:20:33.080 --> 04:20:34.260
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Maraming salamat po for answering.

asr-004430
04:20:34.260 --> 04:20:35.720
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: And nakakatuwa po marinig na

asr-004431
04:20:35.720 --> 04:20:39.840
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: maganda po ang assistance na ibibigay po natin sa mga OFWs natin.

asr-004432
04:20:39.960 --> 04:20:40.900
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: So, maraming salamat po.

asr-004433
04:20:41.180 --> 04:20:42.180
Rep. Jan Franz Norbert Joselito A. Chan: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-004434
04:20:44.700 --> 04:20:47.340
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Thank you so much, Representative Jan Chan.

asr-004435
04:20:48.400 --> 04:20:49.760
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Next to interpolate,

asr-004436
04:20:49.800 --> 04:20:53.000
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: and maybe last but not the least na naman,

asr-004437
04:20:53.420 --> 04:20:54.700
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: I don't want to jinx it.

asr-004438
04:20:54.880 --> 04:20:55.360
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Yes.

asr-004439
04:20:56.180 --> 04:20:57.540
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: We have our Vice Chair,

asr-004440
04:20:57.760 --> 04:21:00.100
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Vice Chair Bella Suansing.

asr-004441
04:21:00.860 --> 04:21:02.120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-004442
04:21:02.120 --> 04:21:04.280
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Good afternoon to the DMW family,

asr-004443
04:21:04.580 --> 04:21:05.460
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Sec. Hans,

asr-004444
04:21:05.460 --> 04:21:07.380
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Admin PY,

asr-004445
04:21:07.720 --> 04:21:11.700
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the rest of the very hardworking Department of Migrant Workers.

asr-004446
04:21:12.500 --> 04:21:17.180
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: My line of questioning would be about OFW dependents.

asr-004447
04:21:18.340 --> 04:21:20.940
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: This happens a lot in our district where

asr-004448
04:21:21.120 --> 04:21:23.240
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: unfortunately,

asr-004449
04:21:23.460 --> 04:21:24.820
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the children,

asr-004450
04:21:24.820 --> 04:21:27.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the women of our OFWs are those most at risk

asr-004451
04:21:30.080 --> 04:21:32.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: to online threats.

asr-004452
04:21:32.780 --> 04:21:34.820
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: I'm not going to mention,

asr-004453
04:21:35.100 --> 04:21:38.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: but I think everyone is well-versed on what has been happening,

asr-004454
04:21:39.140 --> 04:21:43.140
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: all of the threats that emerge for our children in the online space.

asr-004455
04:21:44.300 --> 04:21:47.660
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: I just want to ask the DMW family,

asr-004456
04:21:48.820 --> 04:21:51.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: if under the Action Fund,

asr-004457
04:21:52.460 --> 04:21:54.580
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: if we have to repatriate,

asr-004458
04:21:54.600 --> 04:21:55.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: because this happens a lot,

asr-004459
04:21:55.960 --> 04:22:00.760
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: where the children and the dependents OFWs

asr-004460
04:22:00.760 --> 04:22:04.660
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: fall to abuse,

asr-004461
04:22:05.740 --> 04:22:09.700
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and we have to repatriate our OFWs,

asr-004462
04:22:09.700 --> 04:22:12.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: does that fall under the Action Fund?

asr-004463
04:22:13.740 --> 04:22:15.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Yes, and definitely,

asr-004464
04:22:15.880 --> 04:22:19.720
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Madam Chair, Madam Congresswoman,

asr-004465
04:22:20.600 --> 04:22:24.980
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: OFW families are at the top of the President's agenda.

asr-004466
04:22:25.120 --> 04:22:27.520
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Insofar as protection is concerned.

asr-004467
04:22:27.640 --> 04:22:27.920
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: In fact,

asr-004468
04:22:28.020 --> 04:22:31.260
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: No. 1 marching order po sa amin ni Secretary Toots

asr-004469
04:22:31.260 --> 04:22:32.460
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Ople ng Presidente,

asr-004470
04:22:32.480 --> 04:22:35.000
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: ang protection of OFW families.

asr-004472
04:22:35.340 --> 04:22:39.240
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: And this is always, this has always been his concern.

asr-004473
04:22:39.240 --> 04:22:40.880
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Every time there is a welfare case,

asr-004474
04:22:40.940 --> 04:22:43.380
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: kamusta ang pamilya, dependents?

asr-004475
04:22:43.440 --> 04:22:45.680
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, short answer is yes,

asr-004476
04:22:45.800 --> 04:22:50.440
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: kasama ang OFW dependents sa ating Action Fund coverage,

asr-004477
04:22:50.680 --> 04:22:53.320
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: lalo na if they are victims of abuse.

asr-004478
04:22:54.160 --> 04:22:55.320
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Very recently,

asr-004479
04:22:55.600 --> 04:22:59.320
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: I won't name the country for the protection of the family,

asr-004480
04:22:59.480 --> 04:23:03.780
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: but we had an OFW married to a foreign national

asr-004481
04:23:03.780 --> 04:23:07.440
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: who was escaping an abusive situation,

asr-004482
04:23:07.920 --> 04:23:09.500
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: and together with the DFA,

asr-004483
04:23:10.100 --> 04:23:11.640
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: napa-uwi po natin yung mag-ina.

asr-004484
04:23:12.280 --> 04:23:16.620
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, we are involved in these types of situations.

asr-004485
04:23:16.900 --> 04:23:19.320
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: As I mentioned at the outset in my intro,

asr-004486
04:23:19.320 --> 04:23:24.460
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: even OFW families who are affected by the distressful situations

asr-004487
04:23:24.460 --> 04:23:25.400
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: that their loved ones,

asr-004488
04:23:26.480 --> 04:23:27.560
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: OFWs,

asr-004489
04:23:27.560 --> 04:23:29.240
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: moms or dads go through,

asr-004490
04:23:29.380 --> 04:23:31.220
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: tinutulungan po rin natin.

asr-004491
04:23:31.220 --> 04:23:35.620
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: Of course, we need the inter-agency cooperation of DSWD

asr-004492
04:23:35.620 --> 04:23:39.180
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: and DepEd kung kailangan may school interventions dun sa bata,

asr-004493
04:23:39.320 --> 04:23:40.700
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: guidance, counselling, etc.

asr-004494
04:23:41.020 --> 04:23:43.340
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, short answer is yes.

asr-004495
04:23:43.540 --> 04:23:45.060
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: But Madam Chair,

asr-004496
04:23:45.100 --> 04:23:47.500
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: I'd like to also request you, Sec. Nicky,

asr-004497
04:23:47.520 --> 04:23:51.660
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: kasi we have an impending proposal with the social cluster ng kabinet.

asr-004498
04:23:53.800 --> 04:23:58.440
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: We will propose to put this forward with the cluster that is sub-headed,

asr-004499
04:23:58.680 --> 04:24:02.220
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: it's a sub-cluster headed by Sec. Arsi Balisacan

asr-004500
04:24:02.220 --> 04:24:05.940
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: So, can I just ask Usec. Nicky,

asr-004501
04:24:05.940 --> 04:24:10.580
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: to briefly walk us through the framework of what we will propose

asr-004502
04:24:10.760 --> 04:24:13.840
DMW Secretary Hans Leo J. Cacdac: kasi napakahalaga po talaga ng OFW dependents.

asr-004503
04:24:15.000 --> 04:24:17.640
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Madam Chair and honorable members,

asr-004504
04:24:18.060 --> 04:24:20.380
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: with the permission of the Secretary po,

asr-004506
04:24:20.480 --> 04:24:27.700
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: the Secretary has planned to have an aftercare for children left behind

asr-004507
04:24:27.700 --> 04:24:33.280
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: knowing that yung mga incidents of violence involving children po

asr-004508
04:24:33.280 --> 04:24:35.900
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: na nababalitaan na po natin.

asr-004509
04:24:35.940 --> 04:24:38.100
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So, it's still a convergence effort,

asr-004510
04:24:38.100 --> 04:24:40.880
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: but the care would,

asr-004511
04:24:40.980 --> 04:24:44.100
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: because there's a care drain for children left behind

asr-004512
04:24:44.100 --> 04:24:45.260
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: and therefore,

asr-004513
04:24:45.260 --> 04:24:50.440
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: yung approach po natin would involve at home,

asr-004514
04:24:50.440 --> 04:24:52.100
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: level,

asr-004515
04:24:52.100 --> 04:24:54.220
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: and then at the community level

asr-004516
04:24:54.220 --> 04:24:56.780
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: and also at the national government level.

asr-004517
04:24:57.700 --> 04:25:02.140
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So, marami pong programa ang ating mga iba't-ibang ahensya ng pamahalaan

asr-004518
04:25:02.140 --> 04:25:03.780
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: but how to tie them together

asr-004519
04:25:03.780 --> 04:25:06.860
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: to look after the children left behind,

asr-004520
04:25:07.020 --> 04:25:09.860
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: yun po yung gusto nating marating.

asr-004521
04:25:10.020 --> 04:25:12.880
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And the goal is to establish a coordinated,

asr-004522
04:25:13.420 --> 04:25:17.380
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: continuous and child-centered support system

asr-004523
04:25:17.380 --> 04:25:19.640
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: that safeguards not just the physical,

asr-004524
04:25:19.640 --> 04:25:21.880
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: but also the mental, psychological,

asr-004525
04:25:22.500 --> 04:25:26.260
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: social and economic well-being of the children left behind.

asr-004526
04:25:26.260 --> 04:25:31.460
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: So, meron po tayong mga iba't-ibang support,

asr-004527
04:25:32.080 --> 04:25:35.820
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: temporary caregiving and early identification

asr-004528
04:25:35.820 --> 04:25:40.280
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: of probably the problems of these children left behind.

asr-004529
04:25:41.280 --> 04:25:45.480
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: It also involves child protection from abuse,

asr-004530
04:25:45.800 --> 04:25:47.620
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: especially sexual abuse,

asr-004531
04:25:47.880 --> 04:25:48.660
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: violence,

asr-004532
04:25:49.100 --> 04:25:51.240
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: and also yung pong neglect and bullying.

asr-004533
04:25:51.240 --> 04:25:56.040
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And there's also a caregiver capacity component

asr-004534
04:25:56.040 --> 04:26:00.340
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: para po doon sa mga naiiwan sa bata,

asr-004535
04:26:00.420 --> 04:26:02.400
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: whether it's at home or at the community,

asr-004536
04:26:02.720 --> 04:26:06.740
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: na mabigyan din po sila ng capacity building

asr-004537
04:26:06.740 --> 04:26:10.740
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: for caregiving because of the parental absence.

asr-004538
04:26:10.740 --> 04:26:13.580
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then yung service convergence na po

asr-004539
04:26:13.580 --> 04:26:16.460
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: na sinasabi natin involving, for instance,

asr-004540
04:26:16.460 --> 04:26:17.700
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: the DSWD,

asr-004541
04:26:17.700 --> 04:26:20.820
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: which Sec. Hans already discussed with Secretary Rex.

asr-004542
04:26:21.400 --> 04:26:24.460
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And then we will also be involving TESDA.

asr-004543
04:26:24.660 --> 04:26:29.180
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: The DILG because at the local community level,

asr-004544
04:26:29.380 --> 04:26:32.120
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: yun po yung mas pangangailangan ng intervention.

asr-004545
04:26:32.620 --> 04:26:34.740
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And the Department of Education po

asr-004546
04:26:34.740 --> 04:26:38.500
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: because yung sa school incidents po na nangyayari.

